(2981854, 420838, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good color and composition/crop works well. The lighting is a bit off. It looks like something is partially blocking your flash or is simply not providing enough light for the left side. Perhaps try bouncing the light and using a reflector or white board to reflect some light back on the left side to get that even distribution.</td>', 'Good color and composition/crop works well. The lighting is a bit off. It looks like something is partially blocking your flash or is simply not providing enough light for the left side. Perhaps try bouncing the light and using a reflector or white board to reflect some light back on the left side to get that even distribution.', '2006-11-01 03:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
