(2982737, 419291, 60614, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for B/W photos.  I don''t know how to described the tones but they are perfect.  Very nice composition.  The crisp focus on the cats face surrounded by the soft focus of his fur just makes this shot.  Well done.  I hope to take as good a photo in the future.  This one should do well and it is one of my favorites.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I am a sucker for B/W photos.  I don''t know how to described the tones but they are perfect.  Very nice composition.  The crisp focus on the cats face surrounded by the soft focus of his fur just makes this shot.  Well done.  I hope to take as good a photo in the future.  This one should do well and it is one of my favorites.  Good Luck.', '2006-11-01 08:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982746, 419900, 62187, '<td valign="top">Could be a little redder? Kinda bright in the face.</td>', 'Could be a little redder? Kinda bright in the face.', '2006-11-01 09:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982762, 418032, 62187, '<td valign="top">Major Tom to ground control...vector heading 2 niner ought dash five, climb to 3500 ft and squalk to 166.275 for futher instructions. You look like you have a COOL job what ever that stuff is! Look out...that blip is coming right for us! Nice shot and thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Major Tom to ground control...vector heading 2 niner ought dash five, climb to 3500 ft and squalk to 166.275 for futher instructions. You look like you have a COOL job what ever that stuff is! Look out...that blip is coming right for us! Nice shot and thanks for sharing!', '2006-11-01 09:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
