(2982860, 421054, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s this kind of photo I was hoping to see more of - especially since it was so close to Halloween. All these kids are driving me nuts! };&gt;) Personally, I would have liked to see this photo much darker but your title makes it work. The ''smirk'' is great...happy horror...how ironic...nice touch. Good luck to ya...</td>', 'Well, it''s this kind of photo I was hoping to see more of - especially since it was so close to Halloween. All these kids are driving me nuts! };>) Personally, I would have liked to see this photo much darker but your title makes it work. The ''smirk'' is great...happy horror...how ironic...nice touch. Good luck to ya...', '2006-11-01 09:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982861, 420450, 66733, '<td valign="top">very nice picture... awesome reflection on her glasses !</td>', 'very nice picture... awesome reflection on her glasses !', '2006-11-01 09:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
