(2984537, 421121, 8437, '<td valign="top">On this photo you are not making the artist stand out from his studio. So, it doesn''t classify to me as a portrait. I''d zoom in on him a little more, leaving some of his studio on the background- it would still work with the fish-eye.</td>', 'On this photo you are not making the artist stand out from his studio. So, it doesn''t classify to me as a portrait. I''d zoom in on him a little more, leaving some of his studio on the background- it would still work with the fish-eye.', '2006-11-01 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984543, 418909, 8437, '<td valign="top">awwww, how cute :)</td>', 'awwww, how cute :)', '2006-11-01 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984548, 419953, 65779, '<td valign="top">This is that old photographer joke:  What did you give him?  F4.5 at 1/60th.</td>', 'This is that old photographer joke:  What did you give him?  F4.5 at 1/60th.', '2006-11-01 13:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984549, 418335, 67001, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2006-11-01 13:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984583, 419085, 67001, '<td valign="top">It looks too fake... Sorry.</td>', 'It looks too fake... Sorry.', '2006-11-01 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984589, 418635, 49777, '<td valign="top">This image is by far one of my favorites of the competition. It captures the feeling of time and motion with the placement of the model. Most would say that the model needs a place to go and should be placed more to the left. However, by placing the model near the right frame, it shows where she has been and leaves us guessing where she is going.<br/> <br/>The DoF is excellent and the colors work well together.<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'This image is by far one of my favorites of the competition. It captures the feeling of time and motion with the placement of the model. Most would say that the model needs a place to go and should be placed more to the left. However, by placing the model near the right frame, it shows where she has been and leaves us guessing where she is going. The DoF is excellent and the colors work well together. Steve', '2006-11-01 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984591, 420441, 67001, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite... Really nice looking girl (those lips!), nice sharpness, great lighting, the eyes really pop, for some reason I like the distraction (contrast) created by her shirt, and I love the texture of the background. Drumroll please........ 10!!!<br/> <br/>P.S. I just wish some of the whispy rebel hair would not be there... but still good!</td>', 'Definitely my favorite... Really nice looking girl (those lips!), nice sharpness, great lighting, the eyes really pop, for some reason I like the distraction (contrast) created by her shirt, and I love the texture of the background. Drumroll please........ 10!!! P.S. I just wish some of the whispy rebel hair would not be there... but still good!', '2006-11-01 14:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984596, 420990, 49777, '<td valign="top">The composition, tonal quality, and simple background work together to make a powerful photograph. Very well done.<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'The composition, tonal quality, and simple background work together to make a powerful photograph. Very well done. Steve', '2006-11-01 14:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984602, 418909, 67001, '<td valign="top">This is my highest vote so far. Very nice!<br/> <br/>Edit: It finished second in MY votes... But I still love it! The Shinny coat, the sharpness, and I love the hat! You will never be able to put one of those on my dog... hehehe!</td>', 'This is my highest vote so far. Very nice! Edit: It finished second in MY votes... But I still love it! The Shinny coat, the sharpness, and I love the hat! You will never be able to put one of those on my dog... hehehe!', '2006-11-01 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984608, 420193, 62095, '<td valign="top">Neat portrait, somewhat busy background.</td>', 'Neat portrait, somewhat busy background.', '2006-11-01 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984617, 419987, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''m not really seeing enough of the chap.  Another angle showing more of his face and less background may have been more endearing.</td>', 'I''m not really seeing enough of the chap.  Another angle showing more of his face and less background may have been more endearing.', '2006-11-01 14:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
