(2984657, 419272, 62095, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that you might get creamed here because it''s not what people consider thinking of a classic portrait.  Good colour.  I''d have liked slight more sharpness on the bird''s head for a couple more points.</td>', 'I have a feeling that you might get creamed here because it''s not what people consider thinking of a classic portrait.  Good colour.  I''d have liked slight more sharpness on the bird''s head for a couple more points.', '2006-11-01 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
