(2984723, 418437, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very strong image. I wish there were a little more light on her face. Love the Bokeh effect.</td>', 'Very strong image. I wish there were a little more light on her face. Love the Bokeh effect.', '2006-11-01 14:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984725, 421143, 63703, '<td valign="top">DNMC ?</td>', 'DNMC ?', '2006-11-01 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984727, 417269, 63703, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Interesting.</td>', 'Creepy. Interesting.', '2006-11-01 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984732, 417866, 63703, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the lighting is a little too dark.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the lighting is a little too dark.', '2006-11-01 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984734, 421111, 63703, '<td valign="top">DNMC - this just seems to be a landscape.</td>', 'DNMC - this just seems to be a landscape.', '2006-11-01 14:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984735, 420506, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really well done.  Great use of makeup and great lighting.  It''s always fun to vote for images like this.</td>', 'Really well done.  Great use of makeup and great lighting.  It''s always fun to vote for images like this.', '2006-11-01 14:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984737, 420879, 58610, '<td valign="top">She blends a little to well with the background.</td>', 'She blends a little to well with the background.', '2006-11-01 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984741, 417158, 62095, '<td valign="top">Funky perspective</td>', 'Funky perspective', '2006-11-01 14:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984743, 418861, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very sculptured with lots of texture. I think a border would have helped make this stand out a little better.</td>', 'Very sculptured with lots of texture. I think a border would have helped make this stand out a little better.', '2006-11-01 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984747, 418335, 63703, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2006-11-01 14:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984762, 420205, 63703, '<td valign="top">Humorous :)</td>', 'Humorous :)', '2006-11-01 14:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984771, 420139, 60701, '<td valign="top">I find the model has too many shadows on her face and neck.  I also find the close foot to be too distracting.  My eye always ends up wandering over to it and I don''t find the bottom of the shoe is visually appealing.  But on the plus side, I very much like the idea - keep working on it.</td>', 'I find the model has too many shadows on her face and neck.  I also find the close foot to be too distracting.  My eye always ends up wandering over to it and I don''t find the bottom of the shoe is visually appealing.  But on the plus side, I very much like the idea - keep working on it.', '2006-11-01 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984779, 420488, 41047, '<td valign="top">i like the processing.</td>', 'i like the processing.', '2006-11-01 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984786, 420641, 60701, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space.  With the subjects right ear off the edge, it almost looks like the negative space is pushing her off.  Also seems like a bit too much post-processing.  The skin color doesn''t look right.  But I do really enjoy the gaze.  It looks very natural.  Good job capturing that with this photo.</td>', 'Too much negative space.  With the subjects right ear off the edge, it almost looks like the negative space is pushing her off.  Also seems like a bit too much post-processing.  The skin color doesn''t look right.  But I do really enjoy the gaze.  It looks very natural.  Good job capturing that with this photo.', '2006-11-01 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984793, 420446, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice DOF.</td>', 'nice DOF.', '2006-11-01 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984813, 420985, 60701, '<td valign="top">I like your creativeness in choosing black and white for this photo.  It shows the two tones of the dogs fur very well.  However, I find the background too light and distracting from the subject.  I would try to use a different location that has a darker background or place a filter (a digital one would work here) that darkens the background.</td>', 'I like your creativeness in choosing black and white for this photo.  It shows the two tones of the dogs fur very well.  However, I find the background too light and distracting from the subject.  I would try to use a different location that has a darker background or place a filter (a digital one would work here) that darkens the background.', '2006-11-01 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984821, 420484, 63703, '<td valign="top">Nice !</td>', 'Nice !', '2006-11-01 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984827, 421143, 44453, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge????</td>', 'wrong challenge????', '2006-11-01 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984829, 419366, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t really consider this to be a portrait.</td>', 'I don''t really consider this to be a portrait.', '2006-11-01 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984830, 419338, 63703, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2006-11-01 14:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984837, 417474, 63703, '<td valign="top">Dizzying.</td>', 'Dizzying.', '2006-11-01 14:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984838, 418900, 60701, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition (except for the thick tree? coming out of the top of the subjects head).  I would also try to get more light on the subjects face.  Maybe a reflector would help here.</td>', 'Excellent composition (except for the thick tree? coming out of the top of the subjects head).  I would also try to get more light on the subjects face.  Maybe a reflector would help here.', '2006-11-01 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984840, 419104, 63703, '<td valign="top">The tree bark is distracting.</td>', 'The tree bark is distracting.', '2006-11-01 14:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984851, 418335, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t really consider this to be a portrait</td>', 'I don''t really consider this to be a portrait', '2006-11-01 14:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984853, 420025, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I like it a lot !</td>', 'Very interesting image. I like it a lot !', '2006-11-01 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984854, 420573, 63703, '<td valign="top">Clever :) Nice use of framing to overcome the landscape orientation !</td>', 'Clever :) Nice use of framing to overcome the landscape orientation !', '2006-11-01 14:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984856, 421121, 60701, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I feel like this just isn''t a photo but a window into this artist''s life.  If I could make a few changes, I would remove the white notepad in the center bottom of the image and have the artist just a little more centered.  The fisheye distorts the subject just a little too much for my taste.</td>', 'Great shot.  I feel like this just isn''t a photo but a window into this artist''s life.  If I could make a few changes, I would remove the white notepad in the center bottom of the image and have the artist just a little more centered.  The fisheye distorts the subject just a little too much for my taste.', '2006-11-01 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984858, 420861, 63703, '<td valign="top">very interesting</td>', 'very interesting', '2006-11-01 14:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984863, 421117, 60701, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting.  Try softening it some.</td>', 'Harsh lighting.  Try softening it some.', '2006-11-01 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984866, 419498, 58610, '<td valign="top">Marching drum. Tympani don''t march well. Nice catch on his face. Colors are very strong and balance his face well. I like the feeling of motion you''ve captured.</td>', 'Marching drum. Tympani don''t march well. Nice catch on his face. Colors are very strong and balance his face well. I like the feeling of motion you''ve captured.', '2006-11-01 14:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984874, 421141, 58610, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t stand out as much as I''d like him to. Perhaps a closer crop or from a different angle.</td>', 'He doesn''t stand out as much as I''d like him to. Perhaps a closer crop or from a different angle.', '2006-11-01 14:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984881, 421076, 58610, '<td valign="top">Boy, you really caught a moment here. She seems so unaware of the camera. Nice use of desat. Great lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Boy, you really caught a moment here. She seems so unaware of the camera. Nice use of desat. Great lighting and contrast.', '2006-11-01 15:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984886, 420139, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great crop. How funny is this? Lighting really works well.</td>', 'Great crop. How funny is this? Lighting really works well.', '2006-11-01 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984889, 420012, 60701, '<td valign="top">I consider a portrait as a representation of some aspect of the subject (which I would expect to be living but I suppose doesn''t have to be).  While this is an interesting picture, I do not feel that I am learning anything about the subject.</td>', 'I consider a portrait as a representation of some aspect of the subject (which I would expect to be living but I suppose doesn''t have to be).  While this is an interesting picture, I do not feel that I am learning anything about the subject.', '2006-11-01 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984890, 419804, 58610, '<td valign="top">My only complaint is not being able to see her eyes better.</td>', 'My only complaint is not being able to see her eyes better.', '2006-11-01 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984897, 418576, 58610, '<td valign="top">You''d think Santa would head for warmer climes for his vacation. Funny shot. Perhaps a little over saturated on his face.</td>', 'You''d think Santa would head for warmer climes for his vacation. Funny shot. Perhaps a little over saturated on his face.', '2006-11-01 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984900, 420149, 63703, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2006-11-01 15:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984904, 420705, 58610, '<td valign="top">Cute. Face is a little orange. Good composition.</td>', 'Cute. Face is a little orange. Good composition.', '2006-11-01 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984905, 420139, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very clever ! :)</td>', 'Very clever ! :)', '2006-11-01 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984908, 420522, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very striking.</td>', 'Very striking.', '2006-11-01 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984910, 421033, 60701, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Her smile is wonderful and the first thing I noticed.  I like that you also chose to emphasize the smile in the title too.  I only wish I could see more detail in her face.  A larger image would help here but I wonder if you could have got the image more sharp.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Her smile is wonderful and the first thing I noticed.  I like that you also chose to emphasize the smile in the title too.  I only wish I could see more detail in her face.  A larger image would help here but I wonder if you could have got the image more sharp.', '2006-11-01 15:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984919, 420818, 58610, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little too dead center, and she''s not looking directly into the lens. Nice colors and tonality overall.</td>', 'Perhaps a little too dead center, and she''s not looking directly into the lens. Nice colors and tonality overall.', '2006-11-01 15:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984922, 419882, 63703, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overprocessed to me. But a humorous image nonetheless.</td>', 'Looks a little overprocessed to me. But a humorous image nonetheless.', '2006-11-01 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984923, 421141, 60701, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve softened the background.  It makes the image look a bit too unreal for my tastes.  But I do find the rider and horse''s face to be wonderfully sharp.  Nicely done there.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve softened the background.  It makes the image look a bit too unreal for my tastes.  But I do find the rider and horse''s face to be wonderfully sharp.  Nicely done there.', '2006-11-01 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984927, 421068, 58610, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark. Otherwise, nice.</td>', 'Just a little too dark. Otherwise, nice.', '2006-11-01 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984939, 420171, 58610, '<td valign="top">Yes. They deserve to live, too. Great lighting. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Yes. They deserve to live, too. Great lighting. Interesting composition.', '2006-11-01 15:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984947, 418688, 60701, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  I wish this man was looking up a bit more though - or that you had lowered yourself to his height (I can see that you are standing in the reflection in his eyes)</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  I wish this man was looking up a bit more though - or that you had lowered yourself to his height (I can see that you are standing in the reflection in his eyes)', '2006-11-01 15:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984952, 420932, 63703, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Arresting ! My top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful. Arresting ! My top pick for this challenge.', '2006-11-01 15:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984955, 419900, 60701, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of the apples... they seem out of place.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of the apples... they seem out of place.', '2006-11-01 15:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984962, 419896, 60701, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2006-11-01 15:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984966, 417474, 58610, '<td valign="top">LOOK OUT! HERE COMES A ...Yeah, I can''t quite get on my feet, here. And, I can''t decide if she needs her fingertips or not, either. Anyway...OH, I''m all discombooberated! (7)</td>', 'LOOK OUT! HERE COMES A ...Yeah, I can''t quite get on my feet, here. And, I can''t decide if she needs her fingertips or not, either. Anyway...OH, I''m all discombooberated! (7)', '2006-11-01 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984969, 420506, 63703, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image. 9/10 one of my top 5 favs. I love how big the eyes are and how they totally draw you in. I can''t take my eyes off.</td>', 'Spectacular image. 9/10 one of my top 5 favs. I love how big the eyes are and how they totally draw you in. I can''t take my eyes off.', '2006-11-01 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984972, 420904, 58610, '<td valign="top">LIke the subtlety in this shot.</td>', 'LIke the subtlety in this shot.', '2006-11-01 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984981, 419342, 60701, '<td valign="top">Good subject, flat tones.  I want the face to stand out a bit more from the background.</td>', 'Good subject, flat tones.  I want the face to stand out a bit more from the background.', '2006-11-01 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984985, 418248, 63703, '<td valign="top">Erotic. The shadow of the arm is a little distracting.</td>', 'Erotic. The shadow of the arm is a little distracting.', '2006-11-01 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984986, 418684, 58610, '<td valign="top">WHAT? I CAN''T HEAR YOU. I SAID, ''GOOD SHOT''! NO, I DON''T THINK IT''S TOO DARK. COULD YOU HAVE HIM TURN IT DOWN, PLEASE? 8. I SAID 8.</td>', 'WHAT? I CAN''T HEAR YOU. I SAID, ''GOOD SHOT''! NO, I DON''T THINK IT''S TOO DARK. COULD YOU HAVE HIM TURN IT DOWN, PLEASE? 8. I SAID 8.', '2006-11-01 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985000, 419882, 58610, '<td valign="top">How''d you get that grimey, dirty look? Very interesting. Definetely one of the better kid shots. Creative and dramatic.</td>', 'How''d you get that grimey, dirty look? Very interesting. Definetely one of the better kid shots. Creative and dramatic.', '2006-11-01 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985006, 420822, 58610, '<td valign="top">And, you treated him gently. Good job.</td>', 'And, you treated him gently. Good job.', '2006-11-01 15:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985011, 419941, 60701, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I like this image because it expresses the character of the subject.  I find so many portraits are pictures of people (or animals) and not pictures ABOUT people (or animals).  You do a wonderful job to show something about this cat and its contentment. I give this a 10 (and if you''re curious, in the six contests I''ve voted in, you are the first 10 I''ve given)</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I like this image because it expresses the character of the subject.  I find so many portraits are pictures of people (or animals) and not pictures ABOUT people (or animals).  You do a wonderful job to show something about this cat and its contentment. I give this a 10 (and if you''re curious, in the six contests I''ve voted in, you are the first 10 I''ve given)', '2006-11-01 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985016, 421057, 60701, '<td valign="top">Good shot!</td>', 'Good shot!', '2006-11-01 15:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985019, 418763, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very serious look. Almost questioning.</td>', 'Very serious look. Almost questioning.', '2006-11-01 15:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985026, 420035, 60701, '<td valign="top">Well done!  A great shot with a candid feel - makes for a wonderful image.</td>', 'Well done!  A great shot with a candid feel - makes for a wonderful image.', '2006-11-01 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985030, 419987, 58610, '<td valign="top">Just makes me want to reach out and tickle him. Your light is a little strong on his face, but otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'Just makes me want to reach out and tickle him. Your light is a little strong on his face, but otherwise, very nice.', '2006-11-01 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985034, 418437, 60701, '<td valign="top">I feel that there is not enough emphasis on the person for a portrait.  Otherwise, nice shot and nice bokeh.</td>', 'I feel that there is not enough emphasis on the person for a portrait.  Otherwise, nice shot and nice bokeh.', '2006-11-01 15:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985054, 417557, 60701, '<td valign="top">I would try cropping so the emphasis is more on the mans face and hand.  I find there is too many other things in the photo.</td>', 'I would try cropping so the emphasis is more on the mans face and hand.  I find there is too many other things in the photo.', '2006-11-01 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985062, 419987, 60701, '<td valign="top">Nice faceless portrait.</td>', 'Nice faceless portrait.', '2006-11-01 15:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985070, 418673, 58610, '<td valign="top">Don''t see why I should. In fact, I think it''s probably a bad idea. A truely bizare shot. I like it.</td>', 'Don''t see why I should. In fact, I think it''s probably a bad idea. A truely bizare shot. I like it.', '2006-11-01 15:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985075, 420711, 60701, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2006-11-01 15:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985102, 420890, 44944, '<td valign="top">I like the lightfall, though the photo seems to tend to black quite fast, therefore giving texture to only a small part of the sweater.</td>', 'I like the lightfall, though the photo seems to tend to black quite fast, therefore giving texture to only a small part of the sweater.', '2006-11-01 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985105, 420025, 60701, '<td valign="top">Very creative</td>', 'Very creative', '2006-11-01 15:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985118, 420488, 65125, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, the lightning, everything.</td>', 'I love this photo, the lightning, everything.', '2006-11-01 15:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985125, 418676, 44944, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the cloth of the woman, however the overall photo seems a little bit too dark. Another way would be to keep the photo as dark as it is now, but use more dodging on the whole person. You made use of the four chairs forcing the photo to have its landscape orientation. Well done!</td>', 'I like the light on the cloth of the woman, however the overall photo seems a little bit too dark. Another way would be to keep the photo as dark as it is now, but use more dodging on the whole person. You made use of the four chairs forcing the photo to have its landscape orientation. Well done!', '2006-11-01 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985129, 418763, 44944, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast to the background</td>', 'Nice contrast to the background', '2006-11-01 15:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985160, 419841, 44944, '<td valign="top">The right side gives the idea of dead space. IMHO it would be better to have the dead space on the left, the direction the dog is facing. I also think some more contrast in this picture would improve it</td>', 'The right side gives the idea of dead space. IMHO it would be better to have the dead space on the left, the direction the dog is facing. I also think some more contrast in this picture would improve it', '2006-11-01 15:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985164, 419270, 60701, '<td valign="top">I want to see more of the eyes.</td>', 'I want to see more of the eyes.', '2006-11-01 15:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985176, 418282, 44944, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the landscape orientation on this high key photo, preserving the details/imperfections in the face. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent use of the landscape orientation on this high key photo, preserving the details/imperfections in the face. Well done!', '2006-11-01 15:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985193, 420972, 44944, '<td valign="top">Good use of the landscape orientation in this photo, however I would appreciate this photo more if the guitar was not cut off by the border, i.e. keep the photo wider.</td>', 'Good use of the landscape orientation in this photo, however I would appreciate this photo more if the guitar was not cut off by the border, i.e. keep the photo wider.', '2006-11-01 15:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985197, 420040, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like the stark contrast in this. It really adds to her sense of isolation.</td>', 'I like the stark contrast in this. It really adds to her sense of isolation.', '2006-11-01 15:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985213, 418950, 44944, '<td valign="top">The space on the right seems like dead space to me.</td>', 'The space on the right seems like dead space to me.', '2006-11-01 15:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985215, 419473, 58610, '<td valign="top">The desat really makes him stand out nicely.</td>', 'The desat really makes him stand out nicely.', '2006-11-01 15:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985223, 419889, 58610, '<td valign="top">Both look relaxed and content.</td>', 'Both look relaxed and content.', '2006-11-01 15:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985230, 420506, 67275, '<td valign="top">I am really scared :(</td>', 'I am really scared :(', '2006-11-01 15:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985241, 420148, 58610, '<td valign="top">Photo of a photo?</td>', 'Photo of a photo?', '2006-11-01 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985254, 420541, 44944, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a very high contrast between skin (partly blown?) and the very dark eyes.</td>', 'There seems to be a very high contrast between skin (partly blown?) and the very dark eyes.', '2006-11-01 15:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985283, 419521, 43774, '<td valign="top">I find the glare/shine too much on his nose and forehead but other than that this is well done. I like his expression. One of my favourites.</td>', 'I find the glare/shine too much on his nose and forehead but other than that this is well done. I like his expression. One of my favourites.', '2006-11-01 15:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985292, 417759, 44944, '<td valign="top">Nice work! (with a ring flash?). Works very well</td>', 'Nice work! (with a ring flash?). Works very well', '2006-11-01 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985296, 417377, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is cute but it seems a little too red. Oversaturated colours I guess.</td>', 'This is cute but it seems a little too red. Oversaturated colours I guess.', '2006-11-01 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985300, 420874, 44944, '<td valign="top">The space on the right looks like dead space to me, especially while she is looking to the left.</td>', 'The space on the right looks like dead space to me, especially while she is looking to the left.', '2006-11-01 15:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985313, 418054, 44944, '<td valign="top">Well done! The texture on the wall really adds something to the picture, especially by placing the person far away in the corner. The high contrast is also very nice.</td>', 'Well done! The texture on the wall really adds something to the picture, especially by placing the person far away in the corner. The high contrast is also very nice.', '2006-11-01 15:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985325, 420149, 44944, '<td valign="top">Even with your given title, this is a landscape in aldscape orientation. IMHO it doesn''t fit in neither exclusive challenges.</td>', 'Even with your given title, this is a landscape in aldscape orientation. IMHO it doesn''t fit in neither exclusive challenges.', '2006-11-01 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985349, 419270, 62318, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the full frame. Nice colors. I think seeing a little more the face would help. Still highly rated photo.</td>', 'Excellent use of the full frame. Nice colors. I think seeing a little more the face would help. Still highly rated photo.', '2006-11-01 16:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985360, 419338, 64795, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture...but DNMC.. who cares.. I''m going to give it a 7 anyways..bwahaha.</td>', 'Awesome picture...but DNMC.. who cares.. I''m going to give it a 7 anyways..bwahaha.', '2006-11-01 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
