(2987457, 418861, 66515, '<td valign="top">Should either be deliberately off-centre or centred. I think if it was centred, the shadow on the left-side would have been more powerful and narrative of the animal''s character.</td>', 'Should either be deliberately off-centre or centred. I think if it was centred, the shadow on the left-side would have been more powerful and narrative of the animal''s character.', '2006-11-02 00:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
