(2987656, 417532, 16241, '<td valign="top">congratulations, adorable photo.</td>', 'congratulations, adorable photo.', '2006-11-02 01:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987665, 418225, 41799, '<td valign="top">This looks like a fairly ordinary pose but something has to be different. Her head looks way too big in proportion to her body, either some weird angles are playing tricks or someone did some creative photoshopping.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, the lighting seems like an attempt at a paramount/butterfly lighting setup, generally a good choice but I think you''ve got the light a bit too high (nose shadow seems to extend on to the lip) and it also seems like it is not perfectly centered (shadow on her right shoulder).</td>', 'This looks like a fairly ordinary pose but something has to be different. Her head looks way too big in proportion to her body, either some weird angles are playing tricks or someone did some creative photoshopping. Otherwise, the lighting seems like an attempt at a paramount/butterfly lighting setup, generally a good choice but I think you''ve got the light a bit too high (nose shadow seems to extend on to the lip) and it also seems like it is not perfectly centered (shadow on her right shoulder).', '2006-11-02 01:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987678, 420504, 60505, '<td valign="top">A little sharpening of the eyes would have made a huge difference here. great capture of expression, lovely colors</td>', 'A little sharpening of the eyes would have made a huge difference here. great capture of expression, lovely colors', '2006-11-02 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987682, 420118, 60505, '<td valign="top">need a little more sharpness of focus on the eyes to make this "pop". Very nice expression. lovely matching color background</td>', 'need a little more sharpness of focus on the eyes to make this "pop". Very nice expression. lovely matching color background', '2006-11-02 01:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987688, 420470, 60505, '<td valign="top">May be improved by removal of blue color cast. Nice composition</td>', 'May be improved by removal of blue color cast. Nice composition', '2006-11-02 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987690, 420415, 49643, '<td valign="top">Need little more contrast</td>', 'Need little more contrast', '2006-11-02 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987814, 418248, 65886, '<td valign="top">I love this one, wonderful model and great pose. the lighting is perfect! great mood it creates</td>', 'I love this one, wonderful model and great pose. the lighting is perfect! great mood it creates', '2006-11-02 03:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987826, 420572, 65886, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, I just think, and this is only my opinion, I would place the left arm a bit differently, maybe so I wouldn''t have to crop it after. it also looks, to me, just a little bit bigger because it''s in the center of my eyes'' attention which enter the picture from the left side and stop on the right. I hope this helps. this all is just my opinion! great idea for a photo.:)</td>', 'I like the pose, I just think, and this is only my opinion, I would place the left arm a bit differently, maybe so I wouldn''t have to crop it after. it also looks, to me, just a little bit bigger because it''s in the center of my eyes'' attention which enter the picture from the left side and stop on the right. I hope this helps. this all is just my opinion! great idea for a photo.:)', '2006-11-02 03:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987853, 421100, 49643, '<td valign="top">Well you made him soldier but he is lacking agrrresive,determinant expression he is looking down which also shows lack of confidance..</td>', 'Well you made him soldier but he is lacking agrrresive,determinant expression he is looking down which also shows lack of confidance..', '2006-11-02 03:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
