(2989841, 421056, 30049, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  The lighting is fantastic, the details are sharp (haven''t NI''d the skin to plastic).  You can see the young adult in this young lady coming out.  Boy are you going to have your hands full when she grows up with all those young men knocking at the door.  :D  My top pick.  Good luck (doubt you''ll need it) in the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  The lighting is fantastic, the details are sharp (haven''t NI''d the skin to plastic).  You can see the young adult in this young lady coming out.  Boy are you going to have your hands full when she grows up with all those young men knocking at the door.  :D  My top pick.  Good luck (doubt you''ll need it) in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
