(2989855, 420804, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun portrait.  Wonderful expression.  Nice warm tones overall.  The composition is nice as well.  One minor "wish" is that the eyes were as sharply focused as the shoulder and the foremost hairlock on his forehead.  They''re not overly soft, just slightly behind the optimum focal plane.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really fun portrait.  Wonderful expression.  Nice warm tones overall.  The composition is nice as well.  One minor "wish" is that the eyes were as sharply focused as the shoulder and the foremost hairlock on his forehead.  They''re not overly soft, just slightly behind the optimum focal plane.  Nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 16:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
