(2992225, 420711, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love this...I might have to vote this challenge JUST so I can vote on this image.  I would love to see it on the front page.  The tones and composition are great.</td>', 'Love this...I might have to vote this challenge JUST so I can vote on this image.  I would love to see it on the front page.  The tones and composition are great.', '2006-11-03 01:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2992239, 418785, 60320, '<td valign="top">I think this picture captured a very thoughtful expression.  The lighting seems a bit too bright though.  It''s properly exposed, but the bright light makes her pupils looks a little too harsh and a little bit of fill light to reduce the shadows just a little would help in my opinion.</td>', 'I think this picture captured a very thoughtful expression.  The lighting seems a bit too bright though.  It''s properly exposed, but the bright light makes her pupils looks a little too harsh and a little bit of fill light to reduce the shadows just a little would help in my opinion.', '2006-11-03 02:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2992249, 420137, 60320, '<td valign="top">It isn''t quite sharp enough in my opinion.  And the background is a little distracting.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field would help soften the background.  It would be nice to see more detail in her face, the lighting seems a little too flat.</td>', 'It isn''t quite sharp enough in my opinion.  And the background is a little distracting.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field would help soften the background.  It would be nice to see more detail in her face, the lighting seems a little too flat.', '2006-11-03 02:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
