(2992260, 420569, 60320, '<td valign="top">Your title fits very well with the image.  I like the texture of the skin and the way one eye glows is a little creepy but it really adds to the mood of the picture.</td>', 'Your title fits very well with the image.  I like the texture of the skin and the way one eye glows is a little creepy but it really adds to the mood of the picture.', '2006-11-03 02:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2992269, 421058, 60320, '<td valign="top">This is one of the very few pet portrait pictures that I actually like.  You actually get a sense of expression in the dog''s face.  You can tell there is a sense of pride, ownership, and responsibility in those eyes.  It''s great!  Good work!</td>', 'This is one of the very few pet portrait pictures that I actually like.  You actually get a sense of expression in the dog''s face.  You can tell there is a sense of pride, ownership, and responsibility in those eyes.  It''s great!  Good work!', '2006-11-03 02:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
