(2993172, 420441, 39349, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments..<br/> <br/>Beautiful shot. I love the play with light to dark around the edges. The focus is exactly where it needs to be on those lovely eyes. I also like the little strand of hair that falls over her one eye. Finally, I feel that the background of the rough rust textures play well here with her delicate beauty. Congrats to you this beautiful model, 10 from this voter.</td>', 'Returning for comments.. Beautiful shot. I love the play with light to dark around the edges. The focus is exactly where it needs to be on those lovely eyes. I also like the little strand of hair that falls over her one eye. Finally, I feel that the background of the rough rust textures play well here with her delicate beauty. Congrats to you this beautiful model, 10 from this voter.', '2006-11-03 09:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
