(2993186, 418056, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, great motion blur in the background with all the hustle and bustle of Tokyo. Awesome focus on your main subject. My only suggestion would be that the horizon seems a bit tilted to the right frame. Still this shot got high marks from me for originality, great DOF, motion capture and tack sharp focus. Well done!</td>', 'Amazing shot, great motion blur in the background with all the hustle and bustle of Tokyo. Awesome focus on your main subject. My only suggestion would be that the horizon seems a bit tilted to the right frame. Still this shot got high marks from me for originality, great DOF, motion capture and tack sharp focus. Well done!', '2006-11-03 09:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993190, 418282, 39349, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/> <br/>I love the simplicity of this shot. I really relaxes me when I look at it. I really like the "high-keyness" of it yet there is no loss of detail in the subject''s face. Beautiful in every way. 10 from this voter.</td>', 'Returning for comments. I love the simplicity of this shot. I really relaxes me when I look at it. I really like the "high-keyness" of it yet there is no loss of detail in the subject''s face. Beautiful in every way. 10 from this voter.', '2006-11-03 09:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
