(2993730, 421111, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. This one has a lovely sky, though, and I adore the surprisingly deep purple/reds you''ve captured.</td>', 'Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. This one has a lovely sky, though, and I adore the surprisingly deep purple/reds you''ve captured.', '2006-11-03 11:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993733, 421143, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I rather like the haziness in this image, and the composition is very nice, though I could wish that the foreground was more interesting - though it is very well photographed!</td>', 'Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I rather like the haziness in this image, and the composition is very nice, though I could wish that the foreground was more interesting - though it is very well photographed!', '2006-11-03 11:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993735, 418335, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I do like the blue in the reflected sky, though, and the maze of branches! It''s a nice shot, and would do quite well in another challenge.</td>', 'Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I do like the blue in the reflected sky, though, and the maze of branches! It''s a nice shot, and would do quite well in another challenge.', '2006-11-03 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993737, 419338, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. Which in this case is a pity, as it''s a nice shot, and the colours are just gorgeous.</td>', 'Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. Which in this case is a pity, as it''s a nice shot, and the colours are just gorgeous.', '2006-11-03 11:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993739, 420149, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I do like mountains - in this case, I''d have liked to see more contrast between sky and ground. Nice sharpness to the snow and the mountain line.</td>', 'Sorry. Usually I''m quite generous on DNMC pictures, but this challenge was so clear that I''m being much more harsh. I do like mountains - in this case, I''d have liked to see more contrast between sky and ground. Nice sharpness to the snow and the mountain line.', '2006-11-03 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993744, 420711, 64035, '<td valign="top">This is an astonishing shot, that I found immensely impactful and interesting. I worry that you''re going to get penalised for the off-level horizon. However, the colours are great - I particularly like the match between the figure and the field. Having him half off the camera is a particularly bold statement - that for this person, the mountain is as important as half his face. Superb job.</td>', 'This is an astonishing shot, that I found immensely impactful and interesting. I worry that you''re going to get penalised for the off-level horizon. However, the colours are great - I particularly like the match between the figure and the field. Having him half off the camera is a particularly bold statement - that for this person, the mountain is as important as half his face. Superb job.', '2006-11-03 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993745, 420932, 64035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph of a beautiful and striking model. I''m particularly fond of the contrast between the face area and the rest of the picture. Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph of a beautiful and striking model. I''m particularly fond of the contrast between the face area and the rest of the picture. Good job!', '2006-11-03 11:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993747, 418912, 64035, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much. Although a "standard" portrait in many ways, the soft light on her face is nice (though a little dark to the top left). Great capture of her hair.</td>', 'I like this shot very much. Although a "standard" portrait in many ways, the soft light on her face is nice (though a little dark to the top left). Great capture of her hair.', '2006-11-03 11:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993871, 419285, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. One post processing technique you may consider to enhance this image is to Clone out the bright reflective spots at the bottom of each eye. The one on the right is okay, but the one onf the left (her right eye) is a little distracting as it almost comes off as a tear. 6.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. One post processing technique you may consider to enhance this image is to Clone out the bright reflective spots at the bottom of each eye. The one on the right is okay, but the one onf the left (her right eye) is a little distracting as it almost comes off as a tear. 6.', '2006-11-03 12:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993876, 420541, 64175, '<td valign="top">The right side of the photo is a bit overexposed (aka ''blown out'').  Nice contrast though with the very dark color of the eyes.</td>', 'The right side of the photo is a bit overexposed (aka ''blown out'').  Nice contrast though with the very dark color of the eyes.', '2006-11-03 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993882, 421105, 17990, '<td valign="top">It`s a shame you submited you picture so small, I can`t really apreciate it well and it looks very good!</td>', 'It`s a shame you submited you picture so small, I can`t really apreciate it well and it looks very good!', '2006-11-03 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993900, 418191, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice, endearing photo.  One for the scrapbook.  9.</td>', 'Very nice, endearing photo.  One for the scrapbook.  9.', '2006-11-03 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993901, 420026, 64175, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Well done.  The lighting on the left side of her nose is just a little bright so you lose the contours of the nose, but that is minor.  Very nice job.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Well done.  The lighting on the left side of her nose is just a little bright so you lose the contours of the nose, but that is minor.  Very nice job.  9.', '2006-11-03 12:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993908, 418763, 64175, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait and very nice bokeh to enhance it as well.  Good job.  10.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait and very nice bokeh to enhance it as well.  Good job.  10.', '2006-11-03 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993911, 421126, 64175, '<td valign="top">The model''s forehead and above her are a little washed out.  6.</td>', 'The model''s forehead and above her are a little washed out.  6.', '2006-11-03 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993919, 418779, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I might suggest just a little bit more of a vertical crop on the left side to eliminate the bright background on the left side of the pole. The eye of the viewer is typically drawn to the lightest subject on the canvas so my ey goes there first and has to backtrack to the subjects.  I also think you could lose the white portion of the border as it actually takes away rather than enhances the image IMO.  Still a wonderful shot.  Good job.  9.</td>', 'Great photo. I might suggest just a little bit more of a vertical crop on the left side to eliminate the bright background on the left side of the pole. The eye of the viewer is typically drawn to the lightest subject on the canvas so my ey goes there first and has to backtrack to the subjects.  I also think you could lose the white portion of the border as it actually takes away rather than enhances the image IMO.  Still a wonderful shot.  Good job.  9.', '2006-11-03 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993932, 419882, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you had with the photo and it is fun and creative.  Points for that.  I think to pull off the evil aspect, I might expect to see more translucent green or bright red in the eyes.  Right now when I see the subject, I think more of "Dirty" do the burning(?--sorry, not up on my post processing skills) effects used.  6.</td>', 'I like the idea you had with the photo and it is fun and creative.  Points for that.  I think to pull off the evil aspect, I might expect to see more translucent green or bright red in the eyes.  Right now when I see the subject, I think more of "Dirty" do the burning(?--sorry, not up on my post processing skills) effects used.  6.', '2006-11-03 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993943, 421143, 64175, '<td valign="top">I''m don''t deduct for borders, but I think a black border would have been a better choice.  The bright white (and thickness) draw my eyes to the outsides rather than to the subject of the picture.  Great composition. 7.</td>', 'I''m don''t deduct for borders, but I think a black border would have been a better choice.  The bright white (and thickness) draw my eyes to the outsides rather than to the subject of the picture.  Great composition. 7.', '2006-11-03 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993949, 417543, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w shot.  The galre in each lens of the glasses is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice b/w shot.  The galre in each lens of the glasses is a little distracting.', '2006-11-03 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993954, 420705, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great pose on the subject.  Very crisp focus and good depth of field.  10.</td>', 'Great pose on the subject.  Very crisp focus and good depth of field.  10.', '2006-11-03 12:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993985, 418660, 33535, '<td valign="top">i love these live music shots!<br/>the "pose" and colors are perfect, the only thing i''d like to criticise, is the crop on the right of the guitar and his finger.<br/>anyway, a 7</td>', 'i love these live music shots!the "pose" and colors are perfect, the only thing i''d like to criticise, is the crop on the right of the guitar and his finger.anyway, a 7', '2006-11-03 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994041, 421127, 16046, '<td valign="top">colorful</td>', 'colorful', '2006-11-03 13:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994043, 420997, 33535, '<td valign="top">i really love the idea and the crop (it could show i little more of his face to the left to concentrate more on this protrait issue though), it''s kinda similar to mine...<br/>the tension of the photo is immense, caused by the crop, the eye and the point, where the knife touches the skin.<br/>the pp (especially the dodging, burning and selective desats) is quite obvious and maybe a little much, but it surely helps to intense the bloody look of the photo ;)<br/> <br/>all in all: definately out of the box and not the most classic portrait, but it''s a creative idea and execution! An 8</td>', 'i really love the idea and the crop (it could show i little more of his face to the left to concentrate more on this protrait issue though), it''s kinda similar to mine...the tension of the photo is immense, caused by the crop, the eye and the point, where the knife touches the skin.the pp (especially the dodging, burning and selective desats) is quite obvious and maybe a little much, but it surely helps to intense the bloody look of the photo ;) all in all: definately out of the box and not the most classic portrait, but it''s a creative idea and execution! An 8', '2006-11-03 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
