(2994101, 419972, 30049, '<td valign="top">Your title makes me smile.  Combined with her expression it''s hard not to.  She probably has a wonderful smile - why not show it?  Something about the lighting is taking away from her eyes and it also seems close to hot on her left cheek (sunny side).  Perhaps she is squinting a little?  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Your title makes me smile.  Combined with her expression it''s hard not to.  She probably has a wonderful smile - why not show it?  Something about the lighting is taking away from her eyes and it also seems close to hot on her left cheek (sunny side).  Perhaps she is squinting a little?  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994104, 420972, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent bg lighting makes this pop, very well done, should ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent bg lighting makes this pop, very well done, should ribbon.', '2006-11-03 13:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994106, 420715, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice tilt, soft touch</td>', 'Nice tilt, soft touch', '2006-11-03 13:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994121, 420718, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Merely a suggestion, but after the challenge, you may want to clone out the tiny reflective dot on the man''s collar. It'' probably the zipper top, but it makes it look like there is dust on the lens or some foreign object on the glass.  Very nice b/w shot and composition. 8.</td>', 'Great shot. Merely a suggestion, but after the challenge, you may want to clone out the tiny reflective dot on the man''s collar. It'' probably the zipper top, but it makes it look like there is dust on the lens or some foreign object on the glass.  Very nice b/w shot and composition. 8.', '2006-11-03 13:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994136, 418056, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great shot (colors and composition).  Very impressive.  The only critique I might have and I''m not sure how easily it could be corrected as you don''t want to crop any more of that great neon background is that the bright spot on the lower left corner (flare of some type) is a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>(btw, this would be perfect IMO for the new Neon sign challenge) <br/> <br/>Score: 8.</td>', 'Great shot (colors and composition).  Very impressive.  The only critique I might have and I''m not sure how easily it could be corrected as you don''t want to crop any more of that great neon background is that the bright spot on the lower left corner (flare of some type) is a bit distracting. (btw, this would be perfect IMO for the new Neon sign challenge)  Score: 8.', '2006-11-03 13:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994185, 419889, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos you put in a frame for this young lady to hang onto and enjoy for many years.  She''ll probably enjoy it much more 30 years from now.  :D  Well focused on the girl, which is primary.  I have to wonder about your choice to go B/W.  It works fine, but I''m curious how the color version looked.  Anyway, overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of those photos you put in a frame for this young lady to hang onto and enjoy for many years.  She''ll probably enjoy it much more 30 years from now.  :D  Well focused on the girl, which is primary.  I have to wonder about your choice to go B/W.  It works fine, but I''m curious how the color version looked.  Anyway, overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994192, 420612, 30049, '<td valign="top">This guy has character!  The image is a little grainy, but it almost seems intentional?  Perhaps to match the wood grain and background?  Or maybe to mask a face that wasn''t quite sharp enough?  Hmmm.  Regardless, I like this photo very much and wish you luck with it in the challenge.</td>', 'This guy has character!  The image is a little grainy, but it almost seems intentional?  Perhaps to match the wood grain and background?  Or maybe to mask a face that wasn''t quite sharp enough?  Hmmm.  Regardless, I like this photo very much and wish you luck with it in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
