(2994233, 419285, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Hurry up and take the shot would ya?  :D  Love the expression on her face.  An attractive lady that is well represented by this photograph.  She''s lucky to have you behind the camera.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  Hurry up and take the shot would ya?  :D  Love the expression on her face.  An attractive lady that is well represented by this photograph.  She''s lucky to have you behind the camera.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994271, 420115, 50034, '<td valign="top">No doubt she has somone''s heart all "sewn up!"  :)</td>', 'No doubt she has somone''s heart all "sewn up!"  :)', '2006-11-03 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994275, 419104, 50034, '<td valign="top">Aslan is in fine form in this challenge!  :)</td>', 'Aslan is in fine form in this challenge!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994281, 420799, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of someone who is apparently comfortable "being herself."  Congratulations to you &amp; the model for capturing a great moment!  :)</td>', 'Nice portrait of someone who is apparently comfortable "being herself."  Congratulations to you & the model for capturing a great moment!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994282, 420522, 50034, '<td valign="top">Honored experience!</td>', 'Honored experience!', '2006-11-03 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994294, 421098, 50034, '<td valign="top">Amen to <b>that!</b>  She looks like a litmus test for Enjoying Life!  <i>"I''m having fun, Mommy!  Come on!  Come on!  It''s not time to be tired yet!"</i>  :)</td>', 'Amen to that!  She looks like a litmus test for Enjoying Life!  "I''m having fun, Mommy!  Come on!  Come on!  It''s not time to be tired yet!"  :)', '2006-11-03 14:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994301, 419944, 50034, '<td valign="top">"...but I can drop you, like last year''s girlfriend!"  :}</td>', '"...but I can drop you, like last year''s girlfriend!"  :}', '2006-11-03 14:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994310, 421101, 50034, '<td valign="top">...and...Child-Rearing!  <b>"Have FUN, daughter!"</b>  Good advice!  :)</td>', '...and...Child-Rearing!  "Have FUN, daughter!"  Good advice!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994315, 420611, 50034, '<td valign="top">Hyper-focal distance really adds to this photo!  Exquisite Blues in the water!  Good job!  :)</td>', 'Hyper-focal distance really adds to this photo!  Exquisite Blues in the water!  Good job!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994340, 420562, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice little Duble Entendre there!</td>', 'Nice little Duble Entendre there!', '2006-11-03 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994350, 419285, 50034, '<td valign="top">How True!</td>', 'How True!', '2006-11-03 14:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994356, 421109, 50034, '<td valign="top">Lighting sets the mood, tells the story!  I will learn from you!  :)</td>', 'Lighting sets the mood, tells the story!  I will learn from you!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994362, 420818, 50034, '<td valign="top">Another <b>Great Eyes</b> portrait!  :)</td>', 'Another Great Eyes portrait!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994365, 421068, 50034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Great Photo as well!  :)</td>', 'Congratulations!  Great Photo as well!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994366, 418635, 50034, '<td valign="top">IMHO there is more that is luminous than just the grass!  :)</td>', 'IMHO there is more that is luminous than just the grass!  :)', '2006-11-03 14:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994368, 419892, 50034, '<td valign="top">...But not so poorly as to affect her innate beauty!  :)</td>', '...But not so poorly as to affect her innate beauty!  :)', '2006-11-03 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994369, 420163, 50034, '<td valign="top">Woof!</td>', 'Woof!', '2006-11-03 15:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994373, 417532, 50034, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the World, Precious Little One!  :)</td>', 'Welcome to the World, Precious Little One!  :)', '2006-11-03 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994376, 417552, 50034, '<td valign="top">Intense!</td>', 'Intense!', '2006-11-03 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994381, 420743, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!</td>', 'Nice portrait!', '2006-11-03 15:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994387, 420912, 50034, '<td valign="top">You must have kissed it &amp; made it better!  Good for you!  :)</td>', 'You must have kissed it & made it better!  Good for you!  :)', '2006-11-03 15:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994393, 420573, 60320, '<td valign="top">Wow, I know what that feels like... and you''ve captured that feeling perfectly!  Good work!</td>', 'Wow, I know what that feels like... and you''ve captured that feeling perfectly!  Good work!', '2006-11-03 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994410, 418255, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely background.  Good colors and clarity.  Can''t help but wonder how long he had to hold his arm up for this shot (no water dripping and hand/arm seem stiff/posed).  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely background.  Good colors and clarity.  Can''t help but wonder how long he had to hold his arm up for this shot (no water dripping and hand/arm seem stiff/posed).  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994417, 419097, 60320, '<td valign="top">The eye is beautiful, but I wish the skin was smoother, it looks kind of speckled to me.</td>', 'The eye is beautiful, but I wish the skin was smoother, it looks kind of speckled to me.', '2006-11-03 15:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994418, 420718, 50034, '<td valign="top">I wonder if colorizing the guitar would have added a stronger connection to the title, since there is a "little Red" in many wood grains.  (I''m guessing that "Rosita" is the title of the piece being played.)  At any rate, Great composition &amp; Great photo!  :)</td>', 'I wonder if colorizing the guitar would have added a stronger connection to the title, since there is a "little Red" in many wood grains.  (I''m guessing that "Rosita" is the title of the piece being played.)  At any rate, Great composition & Great photo!  :)', '2006-11-03 15:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994420, 419817, 50034, '<td valign="top">Clearly Brilliant!  :)</td>', 'Clearly Brilliant!  :)', '2006-11-03 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994426, 417682, 30049, '<td valign="top">And she''s STILL waiting while you take the photograph.  :D  Items well positioned for this shot.  Nice color tones.  The texture in her jacket seems almost 3D-ish - jumps right out there.  Proper expression on her face.  Only nit is her hat blending into the wall being the same colors.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'And she''s STILL waiting while you take the photograph.  :D  Items well positioned for this shot.  Nice color tones.  The texture in her jacket seems almost 3D-ish - jumps right out there.  Proper expression on her face.  Only nit is her hat blending into the wall being the same colors.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 15:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994428, 420715, 60320, '<td valign="top">Dramatic tones in this image.  I like it.</td>', 'Dramatic tones in this image.  I like it.', '2006-11-03 15:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994436, 420026, 60320, '<td valign="top">It''s nice picture, but I get a sense of too much processing.  The soft skin and the extremely sharp, white eyes make me feel like I''m looking at a photo of a porcelain doll...  I dunno, I''m kinda in the "uncanny valley" with this one.<br/> <br/>//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uncanny_Valley</td>', 'It''s nice picture, but I get a sense of too much processing.  The soft skin and the extremely sharp, white eyes make me feel like I''m looking at a photo of a porcelain doll...  I dunno, I''m kinda in the "uncanny valley" with this one. //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uncanny_Valley', '2006-11-03 15:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994438, 421046, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on her face.  Nice candid pose.  Wish the tonal range was a little wider.  Either needs some levels adjustment and/or added contrast IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the expression on her face.  Nice candid pose.  Wish the tonal range was a little wider.  Either needs some levels adjustment and/or added contrast IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 15:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994447, 417543, 60320, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the glasses detract from the image a bit, although I realise they''d be really difficult avoid.  A taller crop would be nice, so we can see his chin... it''s just a little too tight in my opinion.</td>', 'The reflections on the glasses detract from the image a bit, although I realise they''d be really difficult avoid.  A taller crop would be nice, so we can see his chin... it''s just a little too tight in my opinion.', '2006-11-03 15:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994462, 420569, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is my fovorite for this challenge. Its effect plays on the imaginations like those highly effective movie posters. The lighting is superb and enough detail captured to aid the effect. 9</td>', 'This image is my fovorite for this challenge. Its effect plays on the imaginations like those highly effective movie posters. The lighting is superb and enough detail captured to aid the effect. 9', '2006-11-03 15:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994465, 419521, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice sweet devilish expression. 7</td>', 'Nice sweet devilish expression. 7', '2006-11-03 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994471, 421010, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nic eye capture. 7</td>', 'Nic eye capture. 7', '2006-11-03 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994478, 418364, 22734, '<td valign="top">Simply superb. The colors in these animals are so rich in that clay red. 8</td>', 'Simply superb. The colors in these animals are so rich in that clay red. 8', '2006-11-03 15:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994480, 419291, 22734, '<td valign="top">Sheer beauty and grace. 7</td>', 'Sheer beauty and grace. 7', '2006-11-03 15:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994481, 418763, 60320, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Her expression is wonderful and the exposure is good.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Her expression is wonderful and the exposure is good.', '2006-11-03 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994487, 418909, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lol. I am stuck with cats but do dogs cooperate! Splendid capture. 7</td>', 'Lol. I am stuck with cats but do dogs cooperate! Splendid capture. 7', '2006-11-03 15:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994490, 418660, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well captured. 7</td>', 'Very well captured. 7', '2006-11-03 15:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994494, 420675, 31443, '<td valign="top">Awww that''s so lovely, what a cheerful little girl, got to love her!</td>', 'Awww that''s so lovely, what a cheerful little girl, got to love her!', '2006-11-03 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994498, 420463, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very neatly done imparting a feeling of submission to the forces that shape us. 7</td>', 'Very neatly done imparting a feeling of submission to the forces that shape us. 7', '2006-11-03 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
