(2995563, 420012, 62187, '<td valign="top">Mom...where have you been hiding!?!?!?!!?! Nice job with the light. I hoped to see more ''Horror'' images this challenge. I''m told most DPC''ers don''t like it. I should know...I''m scoring yours higher then mine...check it out when the challenge is over. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'Mom...where have you been hiding!?!?!?!!?! Nice job with the light. I hoped to see more ''Horror'' images this challenge. I''m told most DPC''ers don''t like it. I should know...I''m scoring yours higher then mine...check it out when the challenge is over. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995567, 419179, 62187, '<td valign="top">It was advanced editing and not advanced make-up! Just kidding...kid. (Stop it and behave!) Good luck to ya!</td>', 'It was advanced editing and not advanced make-up! Just kidding...kid. (Stop it and behave!) Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995573, 419076, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I won''t be the first to comment on your photo...so, I''ll let the others do the talking while I just stare. };&gt;)</td>', 'I''m sure I won''t be the first to comment on your photo...so, I''ll let the others do the talking while I just stare. };>)', '2006-11-03 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995578, 418248, 62187, '<td valign="top">Whoa...put your toe away...it''s freaking me out man! Good luck to ya.</td>', 'Whoa...put your toe away...it''s freaking me out man! Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 19:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995584, 421017, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s a light saber. Mine''s in the shop. Nice contrasting colors. Good luck to ya! Hey, I had to come back...great job on the border! I''ll bump it up for that...</td>', 'I hope that''s a light saber. Mine''s in the shop. Nice contrasting colors. Good luck to ya! Hey, I had to come back...great job on the border! I''ll bump it up for that...', '2006-11-03 19:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995589, 420149, 62187, '<td valign="top">You did this on purpose...landscape as portrait...father and son? Hope so...good luck to ya! It looks like it could be tilted slightly to the right...towards the ''son''.</td>', 'You did this on purpose...landscape as portrait...father and son? Hope so...good luck to ya! It looks like it could be tilted slightly to the right...towards the ''son''.', '2006-11-03 19:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995590, 417823, 62187, '<td valign="top">Then...ah...shouldn''t you be lookin'' at the road and not the camera? Good luck to ya! Sir...</td>', 'Then...ah...shouldn''t you be lookin'' at the road and not the camera? Good luck to ya! Sir...', '2006-11-03 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995600, 419541, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a far-away portrait don''t you think? Wrong challenge maybe? Not to worry...I don''t give out 1''s anymore. Nor 2''s or 3''s. It''s a very nice photo and looks like a great place to drift. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'It''s kind of a far-away portrait don''t you think? Wrong challenge maybe? Not to worry...I don''t give out 1''s anymore. Nor 2''s or 3''s. It''s a very nice photo and looks like a great place to drift. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995603, 420205, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes ma''am. Good luck to ya''ll...!</td>', 'Yes ma''am. Good luck to ya''ll...!', '2006-11-03 19:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995607, 417475, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little overexposed which could be part of your plan. I miss my Grandma. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'I think it''s a little overexposed which could be part of your plan. I miss my Grandma. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995612, 420516, 62187, '<td valign="top">The crop and color are very nice. Good luck to ya! Wait...is that a tag on the shirt!</td>', 'The crop and color are very nice. Good luck to ya! Wait...is that a tag on the shirt!', '2006-11-03 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995616, 421077, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo looks really dreary and the focus a little off. Maybe they were meant to go hand-in-hand? Good luck to ya!</td>', 'The photo looks really dreary and the focus a little off. Maybe they were meant to go hand-in-hand? Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995620, 418282, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...great focus but really, really bright! How could anybody sleep like that? WAKE UP! };&gt;) Good luck to ya!</td>', 'Wow...great focus but really, really bright! How could anybody sleep like that? WAKE UP! };>) Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995624, 419188, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why at first glance I thought he was using a knife for a bookmark. That would have been creepy! Good luck to ya!</td>', 'I don''t know why at first glance I thought he was using a knife for a bookmark. That would have been creepy! Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995632, 419953, 62187, '<td valign="top">We have people like this in Las Vegas too...it''s sad to see. I work with them all the time (I''m an EMT). Even in the middle of the summer, they still wear all their cloths just like your man - bacause they have np place to keep them and they are afraid of having them stolen. A lot of them die each year of heat stroke. Anyway...sorry if I brought you down with my story. AS far as the photo...maybe if he was all in the sun or in shadow...it might imporve your photo some more. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'We have people like this in Las Vegas too...it''s sad to see. I work with them all the time (I''m an EMT). Even in the middle of the summer, they still wear all their cloths just like your man - bacause they have np place to keep them and they are afraid of having them stolen. A lot of them die each year of heat stroke. Anyway...sorry if I brought you down with my story. AS far as the photo...maybe if he was all in the sun or in shadow...it might imporve your photo some more. Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995635, 418272, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s already made his choice and used all of them! Good luck to ya!</td>', 'Looks like he''s already made his choice and used all of them! Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995636, 420438, 62187, '<td valign="top">Upside down would have been more goofy...I think? Good luck to ya!</td>', 'Upside down would have been more goofy...I think? Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995639, 418617, 62187, '<td valign="top">Great job with the helmet and remember to always wear your shades on a lanyard! (Just teasing - it looks like they fell off in mid-jump!) Good luck to ya with your photo!</td>', 'Great job with the helmet and remember to always wear your shades on a lanyard! (Just teasing - it looks like they fell off in mid-jump!) Good luck to ya with your photo!', '2006-11-03 19:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995643, 420450, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh...I see it now...very cool...! Good luck to ya!</td>', 'Oh...I see it now...very cool...! Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995645, 419342, 62187, '<td valign="top">Come on...get up, get out and get a job! Just kidding...!!! Nice photo...good luck to ya!</td>', 'Come on...get up, get out and get a job! Just kidding...!!! Nice photo...good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995653, 419804, 62187, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was a nice touch.</td>', 'B&W was a nice touch.', '2006-11-03 19:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995655, 420580, 62187, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus.</td>', 'Great colors and focus.', '2006-11-03 19:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995656, 418861, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus...I''m wondering why you cropped it so close.</td>', 'Very nice focus...I''m wondering why you cropped it so close.', '2006-11-03 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
