(2996087, 420141, 64928, '<td valign="top">What a precious child with a gleam in her eye. I love the bright pink shirt on the dk blue background with her strawberry blonde hair.</td>', 'What a precious child with a gleam in her eye. I love the bright pink shirt on the dk blue background with her strawberry blonde hair.', '2006-11-03 21:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996091, 420861, 62187, '<td valign="top">You''re brave walking around without shoes, turning your back on us and living in a world tilted to the right like that. But, I''m proud of you...it is certainly living outside the box and I like that! Nice photo.</td>', 'You''re brave walking around without shoes, turning your back on us and living in a world tilted to the right like that. But, I''m proud of you...it is certainly living outside the box and I like that! Nice photo.', '2006-11-03 21:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996093, 421098, 64928, '<td valign="top">Adorable</td>', 'Adorable', '2006-11-03 21:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996096, 418912, 62187, '<td valign="top">I a challenge with advanced editing, I was hoping for more creativeness rather then snap-shotedness - so many people went with something that would have worked with basic editing...but oh well...you''ve still got a nice photo here.</td>', 'I a challenge with advanced editing, I was hoping for more creativeness rather then snap-shotedness - so many people went with something that would have worked with basic editing...but oh well...you''ve still got a nice photo here.', '2006-11-03 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996097, 418514, 64928, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop.  It gives it a movie strip feel.</td>', 'Interesting crop.  It gives it a movie strip feel.', '2006-11-03 21:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996099, 420904, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus is very nice and I''m sure I''ve seen you here before. Right?</td>', 'The focus is very nice and I''m sure I''ve seen you here before. Right?', '2006-11-03 21:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996101, 417759, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh man...you should have incorperated your ink more into the photo...dang! Nice photo regardless.</td>', 'Oh man...you should have incorperated your ink more into the photo...dang! Nice photo regardless.', '2006-11-03 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996105, 420890, 62187, '<td valign="top">I try to forget as much as possible. Nice photo.</td>', 'I try to forget as much as possible. Nice photo.', '2006-11-03 21:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996111, 420603, 62187, '<td valign="top">No, I''m Raleigh...I get more coupons that way. See??? I''m not sure about the edit of the photo. There is some noise that could have been smoothed out I think. In a way, it works with the rest of the photo.</td>', 'No, I''m Raleigh...I get more coupons that way. See??? I''m not sure about the edit of the photo. There is some noise that could have been smoothed out I think. In a way, it works with the rest of the photo.', '2006-11-03 21:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996113, 419457, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure a sihlouette is what they were looking for...but...I do like the background color but think I would have liked it better without the vignette affect. The focus is good. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'I''m not really sure a sihlouette is what they were looking for...but...I do like the background color but think I would have liked it better without the vignette affect. The focus is good. Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 21:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996120, 420747, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like ''Horror'' type photos. The ''Ghost'' is just a little to ''Ghosty'' and it kinds strayed from the challenge. I still like it...I hope the other voters do to. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'I like ''Horror'' type photos. The ''Ghost'' is just a little to ''Ghosty'' and it kinds strayed from the challenge. I still like it...I hope the other voters do to. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 21:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996121, 418225, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a happy looking person. Very nice focus.</td>', 'What a happy looking person. Very nice focus.', '2006-11-03 21:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996122, 420993, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like you got this guy with the flash at night? Nice job with the focus if so.</td>', 'Looks like you got this guy with the flash at night? Nice job with the focus if so.', '2006-11-03 21:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996125, 418785, 62187, '<td valign="top">Another really tight crop that I don''t get but nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'Another really tight crop that I don''t get but nice shot otherwise.', '2006-11-03 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996127, 417659, 62187, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential here...the white is just too bright making the edges look unatural. Nice capture otherwise.</td>', 'Lots of potential here...the white is just too bright making the edges look unatural. Nice capture otherwise.', '2006-11-03 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996130, 421121, 62187, '<td valign="top">I gotta get me one of those lenses. That''s a lot of stuff in there. Somebody told me one time I had a cluttered image - less stuff then you got going on here. I don''t find it cluttered. It''s intersting to see into other people''s lives and see their ''stuff''. Nice work.</td>', 'I gotta get me one of those lenses. That''s a lot of stuff in there. Somebody told me one time I had a cluttered image - less stuff then you got going on here. I don''t find it cluttered. It''s intersting to see into other people''s lives and see their ''stuff''. Nice work.', '2006-11-03 21:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996132, 420899, 62187, '<td valign="top">Weird...are those lights supposed to be the Cops or Paramedics? Nice photo.</td>', 'Weird...are those lights supposed to be the Cops or Paramedics? Nice photo.', '2006-11-03 21:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996133, 420879, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice conversion with the background.</td>', 'Nice conversion with the background.', '2006-11-03 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996134, 419111, 62187, '<td valign="top">I try not to...nice photo.</td>', 'I try not to...nice photo.', '2006-11-03 21:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996138, 420713, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet I know what he''s thinking. He''s thinking, man, I can''t wait to grow up so I can move out and quite having my picture taken! Just kidding...nice capture.</td>', 'I''ll bet I know what he''s thinking. He''s thinking, man, I can''t wait to grow up so I can move out and quite having my picture taken! Just kidding...nice capture.', '2006-11-03 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996140, 420074, 62187, '<td valign="top">I wonder who''s doing the dreaming? The subject or the photog. Just teasing...nice capture.</td>', 'I wonder who''s doing the dreaming? The subject or the photog. Just teasing...nice capture.', '2006-11-03 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996141, 418366, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think a stronger focus would have improved your photo...good luck to ya.</td>', 'I think a stronger focus would have improved your photo...good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 21:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996143, 418119, 62187, '<td valign="top">I wish I still had my Grandma...she was great. Thanks for sharing yours with us. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'I wish I still had my Grandma...she was great. Thanks for sharing yours with us. Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996145, 417882, 62187, '<td valign="top">Little more focus?</td>', 'Little more focus?', '2006-11-03 22:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996147, 420141, 62187, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be really strong on her hair...not so much in the eyes. Maybe a little selective sharpening?</td>', 'Focus seems to be really strong on her hair...not so much in the eyes. Maybe a little selective sharpening?', '2006-11-03 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996148, 420985, 62187, '<td valign="top">Something is strange to me about the dogs tongue - like it almost doesn''t belong there. The focus on his head is really, really good.</td>', 'Something is strange to me about the dogs tongue - like it almost doesn''t belong there. The focus on his head is really, really good.', '2006-11-03 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996149, 418676, 62187, '<td valign="top">The mood of the photo and the color are convincing...but sad. Nice job.</td>', 'The mood of the photo and the color are convincing...but sad. Nice job.', '2006-11-03 22:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996152, 419075, 62187, '<td valign="top">Almost studio-like...maybe just a tad bit sharper?</td>', 'Almost studio-like...maybe just a tad bit sharper?', '2006-11-03 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996154, 419473, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me...your edit is great...except...I think a little selective blur on the edges would have put your photo on top. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'To me...your edit is great...except...I think a little selective blur on the edges would have put your photo on top. Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996156, 418576, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope he''s getting us lots of cool souveniers along the way. A little dark but not too bad. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'I hope he''s getting us lots of cool souveniers along the way. A little dark but not too bad. Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 22:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996161, 419316, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like he needs an alka-seltzer...sour stomach...the red and blue are a little strong for me.</td>', 'Looks like he needs an alka-seltzer...sour stomach...the red and blue are a little strong for me.', '2006-11-03 22:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996162, 418660, 62187, '<td valign="top">The lighting a capture are great. I do feel though it is a little oversharpened - some jaggies around his arms. I think it could have been fixed especially with advanced editing with the blur tool.</td>', 'The lighting a capture are great. I do feel though it is a little oversharpened - some jaggies around his arms. I think it could have been fixed especially with advanced editing with the blur tool.', '2006-11-03 22:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996172, 417949, 62187, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little use of ''Rule of Thirds'' and a three-line border would have improved the over-all appearence of the photo? Otherwise...nice!</td>', 'Maybe a little use of ''Rule of Thirds'' and a three-line border would have improved the over-all appearence of the photo? Otherwise...nice!', '2006-11-03 22:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996174, 420137, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice soft photo...the lines in the fence are making it look like it''s got the leans. Otherwise...very nice.</td>', 'Nice soft photo...the lines in the fence are making it look like it''s got the leans. Otherwise...very nice.', '2006-11-03 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996178, 419097, 62187, '<td valign="top">You look way to young to know that song by Santana...but...old enough to know how to use a camera really good. Nice!</td>', 'You look way to young to know that song by Santana...but...old enough to know how to use a camera really good. Nice!', '2006-11-03 22:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996180, 418900, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good job with the edit...a little vignette around the top though. Overall...nice.</td>', 'Good job with the edit...a little vignette around the top though. Overall...nice.', '2006-11-03 22:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996181, 418790, 64928, '<td valign="top">Precious baby.  I think this would be better with a little more exposure to lighten it. I''m not a professional, though...just my opinion.</td>', 'Precious baby.  I think this would be better with a little more exposure to lighten it. I''m not a professional, though...just my opinion.', '2006-11-03 22:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996183, 419950, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo but I don''t know who Janet Leigh is. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'It''s a nice photo but I don''t know who Janet Leigh is. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996188, 420139, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the background...no lines and you still got some shadow.</td>', 'Nice job with the background...no lines and you still got some shadow.', '2006-11-03 22:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996191, 417377, 62187, '<td valign="top">Cute and very festive for the seasons.</td>', 'Cute and very festive for the seasons.', '2006-11-03 22:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996195, 421111, 64928, '<td valign="top">oops, wrong challenge.  Sorry.  It''s a beautiful picture, just out of place</td>', 'oops, wrong challenge.  Sorry.  It''s a beautiful picture, just out of place', '2006-11-03 22:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996198, 417846, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve got a lot of heavy reading behind you. Nice photo too!</td>', 'Looks like you''ve got a lot of heavy reading behind you. Nice photo too!', '2006-11-03 22:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996207, 418442, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh come on...the sun is shining, the birds are singing......I made you breakfast. Nothing? Don''t be so sad...hey, I found you...that''s got to count for something!</td>', 'Oh come on...the sun is shining, the birds are singing......I made you breakfast. Nothing? Don''t be so sad...hey, I found you...that''s got to count for something!', '2006-11-03 22:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996211, 420578, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...the thumbnailed version of your photo had me really curious. They say curiosity killed the cat but satisfaction brought it back. I''m glad I looked now...nice job!</td>', 'Wow...the thumbnailed version of your photo had me really curious. They say curiosity killed the cat but satisfaction brought it back. I''m glad I looked now...nice job!', '2006-11-03 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996214, 420945, 62187, '<td valign="top">...according to YOU...get it? Get it? Funny huh! No? Oh well...nice color and focus. Good luck to ya!</td>', '...according to YOU...get it? Get it? Funny huh! No? Oh well...nice color and focus. Good luck to ya!', '2006-11-03 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996218, 419315, 62187, '<td valign="top">Really? Candy has an age limit? I wasn''t aware of that. Would that explain why my son lost all of his teeth and the age of 4. Hey, thanks for the info and for sharing your cute photo!</td>', 'Really? Candy has an age limit? I wasn''t aware of that. Would that explain why my son lost all of his teeth and the age of 4. Hey, thanks for the info and for sharing your cute photo!', '2006-11-03 22:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996220, 421127, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo but I think if your gonna call it ''Floating'' it should be more obvious. Maybe? Good luck to ya.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo but I think if your gonna call it ''Floating'' it should be more obvious. Maybe? Good luck to ya.', '2006-11-03 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996224, 420593, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, but how do you think they learn to tell who''s really sick!</td>', 'Yeah, but how do you think they learn to tell who''s really sick!', '2006-11-03 22:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996225, 419266, 62187, '<td valign="top">Bizzare edit.</td>', 'Bizzare edit.', '2006-11-03 22:25:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2996227, 420193, 66515, '<td valign="top">The portrait is interesting but the background (texture, blurriness)is distracting. Would be better cropped (but then probably wouldn''t meet "landscape" requirement for the challenge).</td>', 'The portrait is interesting but the background (texture, blurriness)is distracting. Would be better cropped (but then probably wouldn''t meet "landscape" requirement for the challenge).', '2006-11-03 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996228, 421138, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen you before huh? I know you''re not really angry...you look angry with that look...just playin''. Nice focus.</td>', 'I''ve seen you before huh? I know you''re not really angry...you look angry with that look...just playin''. Nice focus.', '2006-11-03 22:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996232, 418369, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not any more that you''ve blinded the heck out of that poor creature! };&gt;)</td>', 'Not any more that you''ve blinded the heck out of that poor creature! };>)', '2006-11-03 22:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996233, 421010, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea</td>', 'I like the idea', '2006-11-03 22:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996234, 420148, 62187, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks like an old-timey photo.</td>', 'It certainly looks like an old-timey photo.', '2006-11-03 22:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996239, 420716, 62187, '<td valign="top">Dang, you can''t run very far without getting noticed especially if your dressed like that! Put some clothes on man!</td>', 'Dang, you can''t run very far without getting noticed especially if your dressed like that! Put some clothes on man!', '2006-11-03 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996245, 419457, 66515, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have been able to tell what the image was of (headphones) without the title. Doesn''t look like a portrait to me.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have been able to tell what the image was of (headphones) without the title. Doesn''t look like a portrait to me.', '2006-11-03 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996246, 421143, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow... I''ll bet you''re getting clobbered over this! Not only is it presumably in the wrong challenge, but it''s not even in portrait format, so it wouldn''t meet the OTHER challenge either. That''s a pity because the image has a soothing, painterly feel to it. A little more contrast in the background and a crop off the top to keep the horizon off the center might help the image (in an appropriate topic).</td>', 'Wow... I''ll bet you''re getting clobbered over this! Not only is it presumably in the wrong challenge, but it''s not even in portrait format, so it wouldn''t meet the OTHER challenge either. That''s a pity because the image has a soothing, painterly feel to it. A little more contrast in the background and a crop off the top to keep the horizon off the center might help the image (in an appropriate topic).', '2006-11-03 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996248, 420196, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s you twice right? What happened to the ear? Oh, no make-up because it was covered in the first ''character'' with the wig. Right?</td>', 'That''s you twice right? What happened to the ear? Oh, no make-up because it was covered in the first ''character'' with the wig. Right?', '2006-11-03 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996254, 420562, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the angle.</td>', 'I like the concept and the angle.', '2006-11-03 22:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996270, 420818, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting angles (length of bed vs. width of arms) of this photo and how they compliment each other to create depth.</td>', 'I like the contrasting angles (length of bed vs. width of arms) of this photo and how they compliment each other to create depth.', '2006-11-03 22:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996286, 419892, 66515, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s because I''ve been home sick all week, but I could relate to Lily''s plight! Reflection in window (Left-hand side)is distracting from the portrait-I''m trying to figure out whether it is cast from outside or inside the window.</td>', 'Maybe it''s because I''ve been home sick all week, but I could relate to Lily''s plight! Reflection in window (Left-hand side)is distracting from the portrait-I''m trying to figure out whether it is cast from outside or inside the window.', '2006-11-03 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996303, 419473, 66515, '<td valign="top">Cool action shot- it has me wondering how the landing worked out! Colour is effective to draw focus to the portraiture of the photo.</td>', 'Cool action shot- it has me wondering how the landing worked out! Colour is effective to draw focus to the portraiture of the photo.', '2006-11-03 22:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996306, 421145, 67694, '<td valign="top">a deeper DOF would have worked better here</td>', 'a deeper DOF would have worked better here', '2006-11-03 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996314, 420592, 66515, '<td valign="top">Beautiful- her eyes and the lines on her face make me want to hear her story.</td>', 'Beautiful- her eyes and the lines on her face make me want to hear her story.', '2006-11-03 22:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996326, 420990, 65603, '<td valign="top">Great expressionand the colors are beautiful!! GL!</td>', 'Great expressionand the colors are beautiful!! GL!', '2006-11-03 22:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996334, 420715, 65603, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, love her expression.</td>', 'Nice capture, love her expression.', '2006-11-03 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996335, 420506, 34659, '<td valign="top">Elvi, this is GREAT!!!  Or maybe Hanneke took Elvi''s photo?  Either way, it''s VERY cool!  Well done.</td>', 'Elvi, this is GREAT!!!  Or maybe Hanneke took Elvi''s photo?  Either way, it''s VERY cool!  Well done.', '2006-11-03 22:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996341, 420932, 65603, '<td valign="top">Well done and the hungry look in her eyes is a great touch. Love the coat.</td>', 'Well done and the hungry look in her eyes is a great touch. Love the coat.', '2006-11-03 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996350, 420470, 17203, '<td valign="top">This seems to me like a "found" moment, where you happened to see the girl in a good spot and took the shot. Unfortunately, it''s also a "lost" opportunity. The row of chairs and costume could have worked great if you had only taken it one step further: ask the girl to slump over with her chin in her hands and look directly into the camera with a sad, lonely expression. That would immediately communicate your concept. Then crop it slightly to lose the dark shape at bottom left and crop or clone out the stray leg at top right. Warm morning or late afternoon lighting would have added about a point to the score. As it stands now, I''d guess the dull lighting and lack of expression in a challenge that specifically called for it is probably keeping your average somewhere around a 5. Next time, you''ll know. ;-)</td>', 'This seems to me like a "found" moment, where you happened to see the girl in a good spot and took the shot. Unfortunately, it''s also a "lost" opportunity. The row of chairs and costume could have worked great if you had only taken it one step further: ask the girl to slump over with her chin in her hands and look directly into the camera with a sad, lonely expression. That would immediately communicate your concept. Then crop it slightly to lose the dark shape at bottom left and crop or clone out the stray leg at top right. Warm morning or late afternoon lighting would have added about a point to the score. As it stands now, I''d guess the dull lighting and lack of expression in a challenge that specifically called for it is probably keeping your average somewhere around a 5. Next time, you''ll know. ;-)', '2006-11-03 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996351, 420441, 65603, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but not sure the pattern of the shirt fits.</td>', 'I like this shot but not sure the pattern of the shirt fits.', '2006-11-03 22:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996389, 420818, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well above average in this group. If it''s a self-portrait, you''re probably beating photographers with WAY more experience. Nice lighting and color, but I''d crop off the right side- a face positioned dead center like this usually creates a very static composition. Good job!</td>', 'Well above average in this group. If it''s a self-portrait, you''re probably beating photographers with WAY more experience. Nice lighting and color, but I''d crop off the right side- a face positioned dead center like this usually creates a very static composition. Good job!', '2006-11-03 22:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996408, 420731, 59276, '<td valign="top">Hey didn''t i see you in the "wind"? Nice costume change</td>', 'Hey didn''t i see you in the "wind"? Nice costume change', '2006-11-03 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996411, 418442, 59276, '<td valign="top">smile</td>', 'smile', '2006-11-03 23:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996416, 420822, 59276, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and use of negative space</td>', 'I like the soft focus and use of negative space', '2006-11-03 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996418, 420713, 59276, '<td valign="top">maybe a different background...still wonderful</td>', 'maybe a different background...still wonderful', '2006-11-03 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996420, 418598, 59276, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2006-11-03 23:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996424, 419338, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ouch... not only the wrong challenge, but in a landcape format it doesn''t fit the other challenge either. FWIW, the image itself had lots of potential. I''d suggest cropping about 1/2" off the bottom and showing more sky to get the horizon out of the center. Then I''d frame it and display it proudly as one of the prettiest sub-5 entries on DPC. ;-)</td>', 'Ouch... not only the wrong challenge, but in a landcape format it doesn''t fit the other challenge either. FWIW, the image itself had lots of potential. I''d suggest cropping about 1/2" off the bottom and showing more sky to get the horizon out of the center. Then I''d frame it and display it proudly as one of the prettiest sub-5 entries on DPC. ;-)', '2006-11-03 23:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
