(2997608, 418598, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A lovely little girl but sorry but this is more of a candid photo than a portrait in my opinion.  As for the image itself, the focus around the girl''s fore arm appears to be a little soft.  Did you remember to sharpen the image after downsizing for the challenge?  <br/> <br/>Revisititng this image again:  On my computer at home, this image looks a lot sharper than on the computer I used to vote.  Her eyes look very nice and I''m bumping your score to correct my mistake.  The only part of this image that doesn''t work for me is the negative space on the right.  I realize you needed to put it there to meet the challenge but it doesn''t really add any value to the image itself.  A tighter crop on the girl may help.</td>', 'Back to comment: A lovely little girl but sorry but this is more of a candid photo than a portrait in my opinion.  As for the image itself, the focus around the girl''s fore arm appears to be a little soft.  Did you remember to sharpen the image after downsizing for the challenge?   Revisititng this image again:  On my computer at home, this image looks a lot sharper than on the computer I used to vote.  Her eyes look very nice and I''m bumping your score to correct my mistake.  The only part of this image that doesn''t work for me is the negative space on the right.  I realize you needed to put it there to meet the challenge but it doesn''t really add any value to the image itself.  A tighter crop on the girl may help.', '2006-11-04 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997618, 419498, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I realize you were going for an environmental type portrait here but the landscape orientation doesn''t work very well for this subject.  The shadows on his face also lower the protrait feel to this image.  As an action shot/photo journallism type shot I love the motion you captured.  Nice image, not the best subject for this challenge</td>', 'Back to comment: I realize you were going for an environmental type portrait here but the landscape orientation doesn''t work very well for this subject.  The shadows on his face also lower the protrait feel to this image.  As an action shot/photo journallism type shot I love the motion you captured.  Nice image, not the best subject for this challenge', '2006-11-04 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997620, 420074, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A lovely girl but sorry but this is more of a candid photo than a portrait in my opinion.  As for the image itself, the focus around the girl''s eyes appears to be a little soft.  Did you remember to sharpen the image after downsizing for the challenge?  The image also appears to be a little flat looking (washed out).  Maybe a little tweaking with curves or levels in posting processing would help.</td>', 'Back to comment: A lovely girl but sorry but this is more of a candid photo than a portrait in my opinion.  As for the image itself, the focus around the girl''s eyes appears to be a little soft.  Did you remember to sharpen the image after downsizing for the challenge?  The image also appears to be a little flat looking (washed out).  Maybe a little tweaking with curves or levels in posting processing would help.', '2006-11-04 10:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
