(2998257, 418954, 32147, '<td valign="top">bosh!  Look at the lighting on this one - wow.  Great post processing used here - the eyes especially stand out - almost eerie.  Nice job on this.</td>', 'bosh!  Look at the lighting on this one - wow.  Great post processing used here - the eyes especially stand out - almost eerie.  Nice job on this.', '2006-11-04 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998258, 420932, 32147, '<td valign="top">very nice detail.  the eyes are especially compelling.</td>', 'very nice detail.  the eyes are especially compelling.', '2006-11-04 17:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998268, 420985, 32147, '<td valign="top">newfie!?  I recently had to place my 1 year and 4 month old male newfoundland with a newfie rescue agency, as I cannot take him with me on my next move.  Your photo brings about many memories, and I sat for several minutes just looking over this photo.  Thanks!<br/> <br/>As to the photo itself, I wish it had a little more background contrast, so that the viewer could distinguish between the background and the dog''s body.  I know how hard it is to take a photo of a dog with a black face, or all black - its a challenge to get an accurate exposure.  I think you''ve done good and shown a lot of detail regardless.  nice job.</td>', 'newfie!?  I recently had to place my 1 year and 4 month old male newfoundland with a newfie rescue agency, as I cannot take him with me on my next move.  Your photo brings about many memories, and I sat for several minutes just looking over this photo.  Thanks! As to the photo itself, I wish it had a little more background contrast, so that the viewer could distinguish between the background and the dog''s body.  I know how hard it is to take a photo of a dog with a black face, or all black - its a challenge to get an accurate exposure.  I think you''ve done good and shown a lot of detail regardless.  nice job.', '2006-11-04 17:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998269, 419291, 32147, '<td valign="top">good detail and sharpness in the face.  The eyes are well lit as well.</td>', 'good detail and sharpness in the face.  The eyes are well lit as well.', '2006-11-04 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998272, 418442, 45549, '<td valign="top">The front pillow (or blanket) is kind of distracting. Very expressive though.</td>', 'The front pillow (or blanket) is kind of distracting. Very expressive though.', '2006-11-04 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998329, 418335, 66041, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see this as a portriat</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see this as a portriat', '2006-11-04 17:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998356, 421121, 66041, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the fisheye helps or hurts...</td>', 'Not sure if the fisheye helps or hurts...', '2006-11-04 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998363, 418671, 66041, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to do here.   Excellent and creative show with the woman and fans, but the added area provided by landscape doesn''t do anything.   it''s not a color than enhances the photo.  I want to crop it off more than anything.  The fact that it''s a gradient is drawing my eye to the left, when my eye should be on your subject.</td>', 'I don''t know what to do here.   Excellent and creative show with the woman and fans, but the added area provided by landscape doesn''t do anything.   it''s not a color than enhances the photo.  I want to crop it off more than anything.  The fact that it''s a gradient is drawing my eye to the left, when my eye should be on your subject.', '2006-11-04 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998368, 420990, 66041, '<td valign="top">cropping some off the bottom would have made this more ''landscape-y'' and kept my eye focused on the eye/pendant linear relationship</td>', 'cropping some off the bottom would have made this more ''landscape-y'' and kept my eye focused on the eye/pendant linear relationship', '2006-11-04 17:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
