(2998410, 420611, 66041, '<td valign="top">In the spirit of the landscape nature of the challenge, i might have cropped off more of the bottom of the photo.  You have the nice wide landscape of the shore &amp; water.  The bottom of the photo doesn''t add to that linear nature, and doesn''t add much to the photo.  crop it to just below her right hand and look the results - the focus snaps right to her and the screnery rather than on the boat, which is wherre the current photo draws my eyes.</td>', 'In the spirit of the landscape nature of the challenge, i might have cropped off more of the bottom of the photo.  You have the nice wide landscape of the shore & water.  The bottom of the photo doesn''t add to that linear nature, and doesn''t add much to the photo.  crop it to just below her right hand and look the results - the focus snaps right to her and the screnery rather than on the boat, which is wherre the current photo draws my eyes.', '2006-11-04 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
