(3002337, 421143, 1707, '<td valign="top">excellent "try." Good view, but I would retry again too.  Next time, try to get the leaves in color (too dark on the left and middle in comparision to the right) or have the entire landscape in focus. Otherwise, put this pic in Black and White.</td>', 'excellent "try." Good view, but I would retry again too.  Next time, try to get the leaves in color (too dark on the left and middle in comparision to the right) or have the entire landscape in focus. Otherwise, put this pic in Black and White.', '2006-11-05 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
