(3002700, 418688, 45549, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. The positioning of the subject in the center of the photograph makes it even more dramatic.  The details of the cloth and the man''s face are also very impressive, although I expected a few more wrinkles on his face. The shallow DOF also helps the overall impression.</td>', 'Excellent capture. The positioning of the subject in the center of the photograph makes it even more dramatic.  The details of the cloth and the man''s face are also very impressive, although I expected a few more wrinkles on his face. The shallow DOF also helps the overall impression.', '2006-11-05 17:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
