(3007362, 420932, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really love the look she''s giving me  erm, you. Ve-ry beguiling.<br/> <br/>Having cropped this with my hand I absolutely need to see this without that dark, wonky band at the top. When it''s gone she really zings and her eyes are so much stronger. I also think that perfect symmetry here would have been good, so losing that hand may have been better, or rather including the other one to accentuate what she''s wearing. This does work well for landscape in my view, but probably would be more potent with as tighter crop.</td>', 'I really love the look she''s giving me  erm, you. Ve-ry beguiling. Having cropped this with my hand I absolutely need to see this without that dark, wonky band at the top. When it''s gone she really zings and her eyes are so much stronger. I also think that perfect symmetry here would have been good, so losing that hand may have been better, or rather including the other one to accentuate what she''s wearing. This does work well for landscape in my view, but probably would be more potent with as tighter crop.', '2006-11-06 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007392, 420641, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice. I feel that this would have been more effective if your subject were just a little further right or completely far right to emphasise the vacant memory - a bit like a pregant pause in speech.</td>', 'Nice. I feel that this would have been more effective if your subject were just a little further right or completely far right to emphasise the vacant memory - a bit like a pregant pause in speech.', '2006-11-06 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007395, 418576, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great subject but a more off-centre comp would make better use of the frame.</td>', 'Great subject but a more off-centre comp would make better use of the frame.', '2006-11-06 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007407, 417759, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice catchlights - but I find the glare around your subject''s face (from the arms) quite distracting.</td>', 'Nice catchlights - but I find the glare around your subject''s face (from the arms) quite distracting.', '2006-11-06 17:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007455, 420414, 41746, '<td valign="top">Masterpiece. Love this expression. 10 from me.</td>', 'Masterpiece. Love this expression. 10 from me.', '2006-11-06 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007461, 420522, 41746, '<td valign="top">Very, very good. Hope to see this portrait ribbon. Great work!</td>', 'Very, very good. Hope to see this portrait ribbon. Great work!', '2006-11-06 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007672, 420985, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how his body blends into the background. It''s disturbing, like a floating head...</td>', 'I don''t like how his body blends into the background. It''s disturbing, like a floating head...', '2006-11-06 18:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007683, 418779, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2006-11-06 18:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007700, 419338, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is neither a portrait landscape, nor a landscape portrait - but a landscape landscape! But of course you know that by now!<br/> <br/>Lovely Autumn foliage and great light. I would try not to put horizon dead centre though and aim to include a focal point if possible, such as a tree in the near foreground or bird/animal/person for scale, etc. Witha tripod you could get closer to a fern and get massive depth of field at around f16+ and ISO 800 (focusing about 2/3 into your distance here) or so. This could give a lot of drama and some interesting detail.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps cushion your disappointment at being in the wrong challenge!<br/>; j</td>', 'This is neither a portrait landscape, nor a landscape portrait - but a landscape landscape! But of course you know that by now! Lovely Autumn foliage and great light. I would try not to put horizon dead centre though and aim to include a focal point if possible, such as a tree in the near foreground or bird/animal/person for scale, etc. Witha tripod you could get closer to a fern and get massive depth of field at around f16+ and ISO 800 (focusing about 2/3 into your distance here) or so. This could give a lot of drama and some interesting detail. Hope this helps cushion your disappointment at being in the wrong challenge!; j', '2006-11-06 18:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007709, 420540, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good vibe. Subject is a tad indistinct and may have looked better if you''d croopped more off the left side close to junction of knee and table.</td>', 'Good vibe. Subject is a tad indistinct and may have looked better if you''d croopped more off the left side close to junction of knee and table.', '2006-11-06 19:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007712, 419947, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute. Subject is not well framed though. Lovely detail.</td>', 'Cute. Subject is not well framed though. Lovely detail.', '2006-11-06 19:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007721, 421057, 67335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! 10</td>', 'Beautiful! 10', '2006-11-06 19:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007723, 420522, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but not particularly enhanced by the landscape format. I''d prefer this as a traditional portrait, filling the frame. Otherwise she is really great and you''ll probably do well regardless.</td>', 'Great shot, but not particularly enhanced by the landscape format. I''d prefer this as a traditional portrait, filling the frame. Otherwise she is really great and you''ll probably do well regardless.', '2006-11-06 19:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
