(3008355, 418690, 65858, '<td valign="top">Looks a touch too neat-imaged (almost 0 noise makes it look unnatural.)  Intersting composition, nice shot.</td>', 'Looks a touch too neat-imaged (almost 0 noise makes it look unnatural.)  Intersting composition, nice shot.', '2006-11-06 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
