(3008362, 419338, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape in landscape...  unless you were shooting for "portrait of fall".  Still, I bet you''re getting eaten up by the voters.  =)  It''s a nice shot, though a touch oversaturated, IMO.</td>', 'Nice landscape in landscape...  unless you were shooting for "portrait of fall".  Still, I bet you''re getting eaten up by the voters.  =)  It''s a nice shot, though a touch oversaturated, IMO.', '2006-11-06 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008365, 418684, 65858, '<td valign="top">Emotive shot.  Nice work.  I might have liked a little more light in the lower-right corner to see the guitar better.  Still, good work!</td>', 'Emotive shot.  Nice work.  I might have liked a little more light in the lower-right corner to see the guitar better.  Still, good work!', '2006-11-06 21:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008369, 418366, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I''m sure others have mentioned the soft focus - I think it''s the main downfall.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I''m sure others have mentioned the soft focus - I think it''s the main downfall.', '2006-11-06 21:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008370, 420516, 30982, '<td valign="top">And why is the word "elephant" pinned to your sleeve??  I suspect you must have lost a low-scoring challenge... or you have an unusual way of studying.</td>', 'And why is the word "elephant" pinned to your sleeve??  I suspect you must have lost a low-scoring challenge... or you have an unusual way of studying.', '2006-11-06 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008389, 420715, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Chele - this is quite gorgeous.  Lovely softness, great toning, great light.</td>', 'Hi Chele - this is quite gorgeous.  Lovely softness, great toning, great light.', '2006-11-06 21:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008403, 419864, 65858, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but I think the framing/crop is the main downfall.  The buggy is cut off, which distracts the viewer.  I know there''s not much you could do about it, but the background (and some of the foreground elements) are very busy (coats draped randomly, a water bottle, etc.)</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but I think the framing/crop is the main downfall.  The buggy is cut off, which distracts the viewer.  I know there''s not much you could do about it, but the background (and some of the foreground elements) are very busy (coats draped randomly, a water bottle, etc.)', '2006-11-06 21:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008409, 420822, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think there is a bit much soft focus, but at least at obviously intentional to the average voter that way.  =)</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think there is a bit much soft focus, but at least at obviously intentional to the average voter that way.  =)', '2006-11-06 21:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008437, 419315, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cute title - cuter shot!  Great work.  The only thing I have is that the pumpkin is cut off, which may or may not really matter.  =)</td>', 'Cute title - cuter shot!  Great work.  The only thing I have is that the pumpkin is cut off, which may or may not really matter.  =)', '2006-11-06 21:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008442, 421143, 35530, '<td valign="top">Uneven horizon and very hazy. The sky wasn''t cooperating. But in this challenge, they were looking for a portrait.</td>', 'Uneven horizon and very hazy. The sky wasn''t cooperating. But in this challenge, they were looking for a portrait.', '2006-11-06 21:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008444, 419104, 65858, '<td valign="top">The focus looks a touch soft on the actual lion, or perhaps it''s just that there isn''t a lot of contrast on the lion.</td>', 'The focus looks a touch soft on the actual lion, or perhaps it''s just that there isn''t a lot of contrast on the lion.', '2006-11-06 21:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008466, 420193, 65858, '<td valign="top">I wish the background wasn''t so bright.  This would be great with a little more tonal range in the face, IMO.</td>', 'I wish the background wasn''t so bright.  This would be great with a little more tonal range in the face, IMO.', '2006-11-06 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008470, 421115, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cute costume and picture.  I think a tighter crop (while maybe cutting off some of the costume) would have made this more effective.</td>', 'Cute costume and picture.  I think a tighter crop (while maybe cutting off some of the costume) would have made this more effective.', '2006-11-06 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008472, 420932, 62807, '<td valign="top">Absolutely should be a winner in my opinion! Very exotic! I love her eyes, (she is very beautiful) and how they contrast against the softness of the fur!  I love it!</td>', 'Absolutely should be a winner in my opinion! Very exotic! I love her eyes, (she is very beautiful) and how they contrast against the softness of the fur!  I love it!', '2006-11-06 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008485, 419285, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I especially like the non-distracting background and tight crop.</td>', 'Great shot.  I especially like the non-distracting background and tight crop.', '2006-11-06 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008508, 417866, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good shot, it''s too bad that it''s very dark.  Make sure your monitor is calibrated and check the image histogram for this sort of thing.</td>', 'Good shot, it''s too bad that it''s very dark.  Make sure your monitor is calibrated and check the image histogram for this sort of thing.', '2006-11-06 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008516, 420912, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow - emotive and beautiful shot.</td>', 'Wow - emotive and beautiful shot.', '2006-11-06 21:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008517, 421098, 65858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The crop feels a touch awkward to me - it feels like it should be tighter on her face, or I should be able to see more of her body.  Still, excellent work!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The crop feels a touch awkward to me - it feels like it should be tighter on her face, or I should be able to see more of her body.  Still, excellent work!', '2006-11-06 21:56:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3008523, 419889, 62807, '<td valign="top">Very loving and soft photo, love the black and white choice!  10!</td>', 'Very loving and soft photo, love the black and white choice!  10!', '2006-11-06 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008525, 419315, 62807, '<td valign="top">What cuties, love the pose, sharpness and colors. Would make for a perfect Holiday card! 10!!!</td>', 'What cuties, love the pose, sharpness and colors. Would make for a perfect Holiday card! 10!!!', '2006-11-06 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008529, 418688, 62807, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo! Seems like he can really see you! Has to be a ribbon winner! 10!</td>', 'Amazing photo! Seems like he can really see you! Has to be a ribbon winner! 10!', '2006-11-06 21:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008532, 420705, 62807, '<td valign="top">The colors and clarity is just stunning! What a cute little whitch! 10!</td>', 'The colors and clarity is just stunning! What a cute little whitch! 10!', '2006-11-06 21:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008536, 420580, 62807, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! 10!</td>', 'Beautiful! 10!', '2006-11-06 21:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008541, 420026, 62807, '<td valign="top">What a precious little girl! Pure innocence, I like the softness of the face and the clarity of those beautiful brown eyes. Such a sweetie! 10!</td>', 'What a precious little girl! Pure innocence, I like the softness of the face and the clarity of those beautiful brown eyes. Such a sweetie! 10!', '2006-11-06 22:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008544, 419508, 62807, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool the light and dark! 10!</td>', 'Pretty cool the light and dark! 10!', '2006-11-06 22:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008546, 419266, 62807, '<td valign="top">Very Beautiful, your eyes are really drawn to the sweet little girl!  10!</td>', 'Very Beautiful, your eyes are really drawn to the sweet little girl!  10!', '2006-11-06 22:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008551, 420441, 62807, '<td valign="top">Awesome! 10!</td>', 'Awesome! 10!', '2006-11-06 22:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008552, 419521, 65858, '<td valign="top">Technically a great shot.  Very crip, and nice tone.</td>', 'Technically a great shot.  Very crip, and nice tone.', '2006-11-06 22:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008556, 417882, 65858, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little too soft for my taste, and the tonal range is a bit dark, but good composition.</td>', 'The focus is a little too soft for my taste, and the tonal range is a bit dark, but good composition.', '2006-11-06 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008561, 420711, 62807, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful photo of both portrait as well as landscape. Very interesting! And his eyes (well I guess, eye,) are piercing against the the neutrals of the photo. Love it! 10!</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful photo of both portrait as well as landscape. Very interesting! And his eyes (well I guess, eye,) are piercing against the the neutrals of the photo. Love it! 10!', '2006-11-06 22:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008563, 418912, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very engaging portrait.  Personally, I might have liked a bit more saturation and a bit sharper focus.  But that''s just me.  Good job.</td>', 'Very engaging portrait.  Personally, I might have liked a bit more saturation and a bit sharper focus.  But that''s just me.  Good job.', '2006-11-06 22:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008566, 420643, 65858, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is a touch awkward, and there is a bit much chrommatic noise for my taste.</td>', 'I think the crop is a touch awkward, and there is a bit much chrommatic noise for my taste.', '2006-11-06 22:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008572, 421115, 62807, '<td valign="top">Love the sweet little girl, love the costume,love the crop,love the vivid colors against the black, love the title. Just love everything! 10!!! <br/>Hope she won a costume contest with this amazing costume!</td>', 'Love the sweet little girl, love the costume,love the crop,love the vivid colors against the black, love the title. Just love everything! 10!!! Hope she won a costume contest with this amazing costume!', '2006-11-06 22:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008576, 420592, 62807, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clean photo, great portrait capture! 10!</td>', 'Crisp and clean photo, great portrait capture! 10!', '2006-11-06 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008697, 418119, 67001, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I would love to see it in black &amp; white. This woman looks like she could teach us a lot about life. Great job!</td>', 'This is a great photo. I would love to see it in black & white. This woman looks like she could teach us a lot about life. Great job!', '2006-11-06 22:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008704, 420932, 67001, '<td valign="top">Can anyone say ''picture perfect''? This is probably what dreams are made of... Here''s 10!</td>', 'Can anyone say ''picture perfect''? This is probably what dreams are made of... Here''s 10!', '2006-11-06 22:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008784, 419953, 52449, '<td valign="top">I would have gotten a little lower, putting your camera at his level. Also, this would be a great candidate for a black-and-white photo.</td>', 'I would have gotten a little lower, putting your camera at his level. Also, this would be a great candidate for a black-and-white photo.', '2006-11-06 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008793, 419104, 52449, '<td valign="top">Great image. I just wish the lion was not directly centered in the composition (remember: rule of thirds). Even with a landscape constraint, a crop could have worked.</td>', 'Great image. I just wish the lion was not directly centered in the composition (remember: rule of thirds). Even with a landscape constraint, a crop could have worked.', '2006-11-06 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008794, 419280, 32997, '<td valign="top">great capture!</td>', 'great capture!', '2006-11-06 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008798, 418282, 32997, '<td valign="top">exceptional!<br/>she looks like she is lying on a cloud...perfectly contrasted, and every important detail remains...really stands out from the rest...well done!</td>', 'exceptional!she looks like she is lying on a cloud...perfectly contrasted, and every important detail remains...really stands out from the rest...well done!', '2006-11-06 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008799, 418685, 65858, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent.  I love the tonal range and the crisp focus.  It makes me curious what she''s looking at.<br/> <br/>The only thing I can comment on is that there isn''t much natural looking noise - it looks just a touch plastic.  Still, excellent shot!</td>', 'Technically excellent.  I love the tonal range and the crisp focus.  It makes me curious what she''s looking at. The only thing I can comment on is that there isn''t much natural looking noise - it looks just a touch plastic.  Still, excellent shot!', '2006-11-06 23:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008800, 421056, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I simply can''t help but comment on ones this good.  =)<br/> <br/>Excellent lighting and control in eliminating distractions.  Sharp focus, good crop, engaging human element.</td>', 'Great shot!  I simply can''t help but comment on ones this good.  =) Excellent lighting and control in eliminating distractions.  Sharp focus, good crop, engaging human element.', '2006-11-06 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008801, 420705, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Instantly engaging - I almost laughed out loud when this popped up on my screen.  The only downfall I see is that it looks a touch too neat-imaged (not enough natural noise.)  But that''s a nit.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Great shot!  Instantly engaging - I almost laughed out loud when this popped up on my screen.  The only downfall I see is that it looks a touch too neat-imaged (not enough natural noise.)  But that''s a nit.  Excellent work!', '2006-11-06 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3008802, 420488, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Nice, crisp focus, great tone.  The b/w and vignetting really help to minimize distraction and bring attention straight to the subject.</td>', 'Great shot!  Nice, crisp focus, great tone.  The b/w and vignetting really help to minimize distraction and bring attention straight to the subject.', '2006-11-06 23:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
