(3011010, 421105, 67006, '<td valign="top">Looks interesting.  Wish it was larger!</td>', 'Looks interesting.  Wish it was larger!', '2006-11-07 15:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011114, 421143, 67258, '<td valign="top">An attractive scene, but perhaps you uploaded the wrong photo?</td>', 'An attractive scene, but perhaps you uploaded the wrong photo?', '2006-11-07 16:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011119, 419338, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgous light, but the wrong photo for the challenge :0(</td>', 'Gorgous light, but the wrong photo for the challenge :0(', '2006-11-07 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011121, 420149, 67258, '<td valign="top">Portrait of a mountain?  Not really my idea of what the challenge was about.</td>', 'Portrait of a mountain?  Not really my idea of what the challenge was about.', '2006-11-07 16:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011138, 417061, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hey Bec...great shot of your little Miss!</td>', 'Hey Bec...great shot of your little Miss!', '2006-11-07 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011139, 421138, 27133, '<td valign="top">Ooooh...have I done something wrong??</td>', 'Ooooh...have I done something wrong??', '2006-11-07 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011331, 420578, 35804, '<td valign="top">The Zen feline...LOVE this!</td>', 'The Zen feline...LOVE this!', '2006-11-07 18:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011340, 420842, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting...captivating portrait, very well done.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting...captivating portrait, very well done.', '2006-11-07 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011344, 419291, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beeeeeeeeeautiful! The light so appropriate for the subject...very nicely done.</td>', 'Beeeeeeeeeautiful! The light so appropriate for the subject...very nicely done.', '2006-11-07 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011353, 421076, 35804, '<td valign="top">She looks out of the frame as if something fantastical is happening just beyond our view...I just love her expression.</td>', 'She looks out of the frame as if something fantastical is happening just beyond our view...I just love her expression.', '2006-11-07 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011370, 418861, 32147, '<td valign="top">whoa!  Narnia!!</td>', 'whoa!  Narnia!!', '2006-11-07 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011372, 420711, 32147, '<td valign="top">very cool - well executed and great color.  nice!</td>', 'very cool - well executed and great color.  nice!', '2006-11-07 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011418, 420580, 47316, '<td valign="top">Something  about the angle is unappealing. I see what you were going for but I don''t think you quite captured it. I also find the background conflicts with the subject. It''s very busy and she already has a very busy top on.<br/> <br/>Beautiful model. Lighing is perhaps a bit harsh on her left eye but other than that it looks nice.</td>', 'Something  about the angle is unappealing. I see what you were going for but I don''t think you quite captured it. I also find the background conflicts with the subject. It''s very busy and she already has a very busy top on. Beautiful model. Lighing is perhaps a bit harsh on her left eye but other than that it looks nice.', '2006-11-07 19:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011422, 418685, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute capture. Seems a bit overprocessed.</td>', 'Cute capture. Seems a bit overprocessed.', '2006-11-07 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011609, 421105, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, but why so small?  Would have looked great at regular size.  Check out the sizing tutorial in the forums.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is excellent, but why so small?  Would have looked great at regular size.  Check out the sizing tutorial in the forums.  Good luck.', '2006-11-07 19:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011945, 420874, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite!  10 all the way!</td>', 'This is my favorite!  10 all the way!', '2006-11-07 21:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011947, 420932, 14837, '<td valign="top">Love this one!!!  perfect 10!</td>', 'Love this one!!!  perfect 10!', '2006-11-07 21:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011948, 418056, 14837, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, the look on his face, the motion of the people walking walking by, the sharpness, everything!!!!  I''m bumping this up last minute to a 10!</td>', 'I love the colors, the look on his face, the motion of the people walking walking by, the sharpness, everything!!!!  I''m bumping this up last minute to a 10!', '2006-11-07 21:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011949, 417759, 14837, '<td valign="top">I love the catch lights in his eyes!  Very nice!</td>', 'I love the catch lights in his eyes!  Very nice!', '2006-11-07 21:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012031, 418671, 49773, '<td valign="top">Brave crop.</td>', 'Brave crop.', '2006-11-07 22:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012114, 418954, 49773, '<td valign="top">I feel a problem with the composition here. Positiong a man to the left instead of like this should make it much better. His body position is asking for it.</td>', 'I feel a problem with the composition here. Positiong a man to the left instead of like this should make it much better. His body position is asking for it.', '2006-11-07 22:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012134, 420818, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Nice focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Very well done.  Nice focus on the eyes.', '2006-11-07 23:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012145, 420463, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very well lit and good color.  Good job portraying the cold.</td>', 'Very well lit and good color.  Good job portraying the cold.', '2006-11-07 23:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012166, 419338, 33400, '<td valign="top">Stunning color, a beautiful image.  I really want to give this a high score but I''m struggling with the definition of portrait.  Can''t really vote it low because it''s too good.  Aaagghh.</td>', 'Stunning color, a beautiful image.  I really want to give this a high score but I''m struggling with the definition of portrait.  Can''t really vote it low because it''s too good.  Aaagghh.', '2006-11-07 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012219, 421053, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a very good study.  I''m drawn to it and ike it very much.  However, I had to get past the distraction of whatever the white vertical line is at her feet.  It may be a sneaker sole or something else, but I wish it was not there, or at least subdued.  Not enough to hurt my opinion though.  This is very good.</td>', 'This is a very good study.  I''m drawn to it and ike it very much.  However, I had to get past the distraction of whatever the white vertical line is at her feet.  It may be a sneaker sole or something else, but I wish it was not there, or at least subdued.  Not enough to hurt my opinion though.  This is very good.', '2006-11-07 23:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012250, 420716, 7252, '<td valign="top">Some more noise reduction would be well worth the effort.</td>', 'Some more noise reduction would be well worth the effort.', '2006-11-07 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012260, 421072, 656, '<td valign="top">Great colour and expression.  The direct, front light (on camera flash ?)  seems a bit harsh and doesn''t give a lot of shape to the features.  background doesn''t really distract but doesn''t really enhance the shot either - some sort of contrasting or complementary colour with the pink would really be great.</td>', 'Great colour and expression.  The direct, front light (on camera flash ?)  seems a bit harsh and doesn''t give a lot of shape to the features.  background doesn''t really distract but doesn''t really enhance the shot either - some sort of contrasting or complementary colour with the pink would really be great.', '2006-11-07 23:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012261, 420506, 7252, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what "Insain" means but she looks a little insane to me. Quite dramatic.</td>', 'I have no idea what "Insain" means but she looks a little insane to me. Quite dramatic.', '2006-11-07 23:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012264, 419521, 7252, '<td valign="top">The hand detracts from an otherwise great photo.</td>', 'The hand detracts from an otherwise great photo.', '2006-11-07 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012266, 421141, 656, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some great light for this shot.  Soft, no harsh shadows, even from the hat.  He does get a bit lost against the tree though, because of the similar tones of the hat and tree.  I keep wanting to cover up the yellow wall on the left as it drags my eye away from the focus.</td>', 'You''ve got some great light for this shot.  Soft, no harsh shadows, even from the hat.  He does get a bit lost against the tree though, because of the similar tones of the hat and tree.  I keep wanting to cover up the yellow wall on the left as it drags my eye away from the focus.', '2006-11-07 23:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012271, 420149, 656, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge ?  Deep rumination on the nature of portraits and our interaction with the environment ?  Anthropomorphizing a huge pile of rock ?</td>', 'wrong challenge ?  Deep rumination on the nature of portraits and our interaction with the environment ?  Anthropomorphizing a huge pile of rock ?', '2006-11-07 23:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012276, 417474, 33400, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you''ll get dinged for smply turning a protrait to landscape, but it works for me.  I like it alot.  The colors are beautiful, the focus and DOF is excellent.My only complaint (and it''s a maybe) is that her fingertips didn''t survive the crop.<br/>Good job.<br/> <br/>EDIT - back to it at the finish line.  In my top five.  bumping</td>', 'Don''t know if you''ll get dinged for smply turning a protrait to landscape, but it works for me.  I like it alot.  The colors are beautiful, the focus and DOF is excellent.My only complaint (and it''s a maybe) is that her fingertips didn''t survive the crop.Good job. EDIT - back to it at the finish line.  In my top five.  bumping', '2006-11-07 23:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012277, 420990, 656, '<td valign="top">Really good light and a fairly classic profile, though there is a bit of her rear eye showing.  The colouring all works well together, though I find the necklace and sticks together sort of competing for attention.</td>', 'Really good light and a fairly classic profile, though there is a bit of her rear eye showing.  The colouring all works well together, though I find the necklace and sticks together sort of competing for attention.', '2006-11-07 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012285, 419541, 656, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a person in a landscape, than a landscape orientation portrait.  Lovely location though and the kayak is a great compliment to those colours.  Very centered and far away though.</td>', 'Seems more like a person in a landscape, than a landscape orientation portrait.  Lovely location though and the kayak is a great compliment to those colours.  Very centered and far away though.', '2006-11-07 23:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012286, 420874, 33400, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this.  Very intriguing.  Time to bump.<br/> <br/>Came back again.  Definitely in my top five.  bump again.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this.  Very intriguing.  Time to bump. Came back again.  Definitely in my top five.  bump again.', '2006-11-07 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012288, 420415, 656, '<td valign="top">Great contact with the viewer and you''ve picked up good catchlights in her eyes.<br/> <br/>Overall, it feels like its trying to be low key, but somehow comes across as a bit muddy, or lacking in contrast where it really matters.  The hair to her nose is a bit compositionally distracting, the way it merges.</td>', 'Great contact with the viewer and you''ve picked up good catchlights in her eyes. Overall, it feels like its trying to be low key, but somehow comes across as a bit muddy, or lacking in contrast where it really matters.  The hair to her nose is a bit compositionally distracting, the way it merges.', '2006-11-07 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012289, 420139, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very god study.  I love the perspective.<br/>Coming back to it again.  I still really like it.  In my top five.  bump.</td>', 'Very god study.  I love the perspective.Coming back to it again.  I still really like it.  In my top five.  bump.', '2006-11-07 23:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012292, 417866, 656, '<td valign="top">A good expression but the light is very flat/ low.  Doesn''t really evoke a particular mood like a real low key shot, or low light - it just feels badly lit/ exposed.  Lot of potential.</td>', 'A good expression but the light is very flat/ low.  Doesn''t really evoke a particular mood like a real low key shot, or low light - it just feels badly lit/ exposed.  Lot of potential.', '2006-11-07 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012295, 420506, 33400, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid not to give you a high score...<br/> <br/>Actually very well done.  A litte koo koo, but well done.<br/> <br/>Fear (and appreciation) has caused me to come back again and bump at the finish line...</td>', 'I''m afraid not to give you a high score... Actually very well done.  A litte koo koo, but well done. Fear (and appreciation) has caused me to come back again and bump at the finish line...', '2006-11-07 23:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012298, 420904, 656, '<td valign="top">Good simple light, though it feels a bit hot on her face,  She doesn''t seem to be very engaged with the photographer.  The multiple catchlights are a bit distracting, particularly from the square softbox/ light source.</td>', 'Good simple light, though it feels a bit hot on her face,  She doesn''t seem to be very engaged with the photographer.  The multiple catchlights are a bit distracting, particularly from the square softbox/ light source.', '2006-11-07 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012307, 419473, 656, '<td valign="top">Great action.  Wonderful expression.  Really clean composition with the three posts and a very clean, uncluttered background with the fence and grass.<br/> <br/>Post processing seems a bit over the top, particularly with the way sharpening has been applied and the obvious halo''ing around features in the image (e.g., his left shoulder/t-shirt.  This lets down what would be a great image.</td>', 'Great action.  Wonderful expression.  Really clean composition with the three posts and a very clean, uncluttered background with the fence and grass. Post processing seems a bit over the top, particularly with the way sharpening has been applied and the obvious halo''ing around features in the image (e.g., his left shoulder/t-shirt.  This lets down what would be a great image.', '2006-11-07 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012310, 418364, 656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, great timing, big fur ball.  Good colour, even some catchlight in his(?) eyes.  Fantastic portrait, though gives a depressing view of zoo life.</td>', 'Beautiful light, great timing, big fur ball.  Good colour, even some catchlight in his(?) eyes.  Fantastic portrait, though gives a depressing view of zoo life.', '2006-11-07 23:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012313, 420547, 656, '<td valign="top">Fun, colourful, good expressions.  Light is really harsh though and the cropping is very awkward.  Somehow has a real 80s feel to it.</td>', 'Fun, colourful, good expressions.  Light is really harsh though and the cropping is very awkward.  Somehow has a real 80s feel to it.', '2006-11-07 23:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012314, 420441, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good shot and well titled.  She is radiant.<br/>I''m still learning, so take a grain of salt, but she seems to be just a bit over sharpened.  Maybe if her dress/blouse were softer to keep attention only on her eyes.  Still beautiful though.  bumping.</td>', 'Good shot and well titled.  She is radiant.I''m still learning, so take a grain of salt, but she seems to be just a bit over sharpened.  Maybe if her dress/blouse were softer to keep attention only on her eyes.  Still beautiful though.  bumping.', '2006-11-07 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012317, 417662, 656, '<td valign="top">Good colour, with the hat contrasting against the white snow.  The red cheeks/ skin adds to that.  Seems a bit underexposed, with the greyish snow.  Fine light for portraiture but a bit flat -  some sort of reflector would help to give a bit of direction to the light and create a bit more modeling on his face.</td>', 'Good colour, with the hat contrasting against the white snow.  The red cheeks/ skin adds to that.  Seems a bit underexposed, with the greyish snow.  Fine light for portraiture but a bit flat -  some sort of reflector would help to give a bit of direction to the light and create a bit more modeling on his face.', '2006-11-07 23:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012322, 420715, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  The softened overall look makes this, especially with her eyes so clear and bright.  Really well done.<br/>Top five for me.  bump<br/>...Back again, something about the eyes.  bump agaim. My top pick.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  The softened overall look makes this, especially with her eyes so clear and bright.  Really well done.Top five for me.  bump...Back again, something about the eyes.  bump agaim. My top pick.', '2006-11-07 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012326, 420035, 656, '<td valign="top">Good portrait but the background really doesn''t add.  You could have backed him up to the side of the skip and used that as a more consistent pattern for example.  Light is good for this sort of shot.  Having him even out his glasses would help with the strength/ distortions they introduce.</td>', 'Good portrait but the background really doesn''t add.  You could have backed him up to the side of the skip and used that as a more consistent pattern for example.  Light is good for this sort of shot.  Having him even out his glasses would help with the strength/ distortions they introduce.', '2006-11-07 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012328, 420573, 656, '<td valign="top">Good studio/ stock portrait.  Certainly tells the story.</td>', 'Good studio/ stock portrait.  Certainly tells the story.', '2006-11-07 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012332, 418685, 63130, '<td valign="top">Very unique!! I like the colours,intensity &amp; border too..</td>', 'Very unique!! I like the colours,intensity & border too..', '2006-11-07 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012334, 418684, 656, '<td valign="top">Great emotion/ acting.  Would have liked to have seen a bit more of the instrument captured, or a more dynamic angle used.  Lighting is good as is the exposure for this high key shot.</td>', 'Great emotion/ acting.  Would have liked to have seen a bit more of the instrument captured, or a more dynamic angle used.  Lighting is good as is the exposure for this high key shot.', '2006-11-07 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012340, 419270, 656, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I like the real sense of depth from shooting across the costume.  Would like maybe a bit less of the foreground, just so we could catch the eye.  I''d also tend to want to remove the highlight point on the lower right if you could, just to keep attention within the portrait.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I like the real sense of depth from shooting across the costume.  Would like maybe a bit less of the foreground, just so we could catch the eye.  I''d also tend to want to remove the highlight point on the lower right if you could, just to keep attention within the portrait.', '2006-11-07 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012345, 419896, 656, '<td valign="top">Cute, simple portrait.  Good framing.  Light is perhaps a bit flat and it seems  oversharpened a touch.</td>', 'Cute, simple portrait.  Good framing.  Light is perhaps a bit flat and it seems  oversharpened a touch.', '2006-11-07 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012350, 421100, 656, '<td valign="top">Fantastic opportunity and makeup.  Cries out for a dramatic expression or something other than this.  Would like to see a bit of shoulder/ t-shirt, rather than the completely black treatment, even if it was very low key.</td>', 'Fantastic opportunity and makeup.  Cries out for a dramatic expression or something other than this.  Would like to see a bit of shoulder/ t-shirt, rather than the completely black treatment, even if it was very low key.', '2006-11-07 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012353, 417377, 656, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Leaves seem a bit more purple/ magenta than really neutral, which gives a sort of overall pink cast to the scene.  Eyes could do with some light to give catch lights and some life.</td>', 'Cute.  Leaves seem a bit more purple/ magenta than really neutral, which gives a sort of overall pink cast to the scene.  Eyes could do with some light to give catch lights and some life.', '2006-11-07 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012358, 417251, 656, '<td valign="top">Strong use of negative space, right across the scene, including the jacket.  Moody feel and a good portrait of this kind.</td>', 'Strong use of negative space, right across the scene, including the jacket.  Moody feel and a good portrait of this kind.', '2006-11-07 23:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012362, 420450, 656, '<td valign="top">Odd juxtaposition of the sea and land - the reflection and background seem at odds initially.  You''ve found nice light under the shade in what looks like a bright, sunny location.</td>', 'Odd juxtaposition of the sea and land - the reflection and background seem at odds initially.  You''ve found nice light under the shade in what looks like a bright, sunny location.', '2006-11-07 23:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012366, 420861, 656, '<td valign="top">Good to push the boundaries of the same old square.</td>', 'Good to push the boundaries of the same old square.', '2006-11-07 23:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012372, 419075, 656, '<td valign="top">Simple, well lit portrait.  Good catch lights. The arm position seems awkward and you might want to watch for neck creases with the pose as well.  A hair light would really give some texture and depth, or a reflector to your right.</td>', 'Simple, well lit portrait.  Good catch lights. The arm position seems awkward and you might want to watch for neck creases with the pose as well.  A hair light would really give some texture and depth, or a reflector to your right.', '2006-11-07 23:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012373, 420446, 656, '<td valign="top">Cute, simple candid picture.  Great catchlights.  Good feel to this.</td>', 'Cute, simple candid picture.  Great catchlights.  Good feel to this.', '2006-11-07 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012376, 421109, 656, '<td valign="top">great light.  The left shoulder/ background seems disconnected from him though.</td>', 'great light.  The left shoulder/ background seems disconnected from him though.', '2006-11-08 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012393, 418685, 49643, '<td valign="top">Well I am so happy I can''t explain. I got lot of nice comment &amp; rating on this photograph. I will like to thank all the commentator''s &amp; voter''s.<br/> <br/>This is the photograph of my daughter. Well she likes to observe the bus &amp; traffic on the road through the small window in the gallery. Because of her natural expression (which child''s all the time give) I was able to capture the nice photograph.<br/> <br/>But in the hurry of capturing the photo I left somewhat more space behind her. So I have to crop the photo more which in the end I thought gave a square look rather than a landscape so I added that type of border to look more like landscape, which I think really added the photo.<br/> <br/>By using channel mixture for making B &amp; W, using sepia filter I was able to achieve the tonal range.<br/> <br/>I agree, I removed the noise too much but because of that I think child''s skin became smoother, softer &amp; clean, which I personally like very much so I can''t avoid the temptation for doing that.<br/></td>', 'Well I am so happy I can''t explain. I got lot of nice comment & rating on this photograph. I will like to thank all the commentator''s & voter''s. This is the photograph of my daughter. Well she likes to observe the bus & traffic on the road through the small window in the gallery. Because of her natural expression (which child''s all the time give) I was able to capture the nice photograph. But in the hurry of capturing the photo I left somewhat more space behind her. So I have to crop the photo more which in the end I thought gave a square look rather than a landscape so I added that type of border to look more like landscape, which I think really added the photo. By using channel mixture for making B & W, using sepia filter I was able to achieve the tonal range. I agree, I removed the noise too much but because of that I think child''s skin became smoother, softer & clean, which I personally like very much so I can''t avoid the temptation for doing that.', '2006-11-08 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012395, 418056, 41337, '<td valign="top">4th place and you did it without a female model! That''s gets a double congrats!</td>', '4th place and you did it without a female model! That''s gets a double congrats!', '2006-11-08 00:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012398, 421056, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, you did it!  Congratulations!  I like this one very much.  She''s so beautiful.  In a couple years you''re going to have to fight off Larus and others you know.</td>', 'Hey, you did it!  Congratulations!  I like this one very much.  She''s so beautiful.  In a couple years you''re going to have to fight off Larus and others you know.', '2006-11-08 00:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012401, 420932, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 05:04:22.</i></td>', 'Congrats!', '2006-11-08 00:33:49.000000', '2006-11-08 05:04:22.000000', 0),
(3012408, 421056, 41337, '<td valign="top">She''s a doll. Congrats!</td>', 'She''s a doll. Congrats!', '2006-11-08 00:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012409, 421056, 65858, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Scalvert - it was tied for first in my book.  Simply excellent work!</td>', 'Congrats, Scalvert - it was tied for first in my book.  Simply excellent work!', '2006-11-08 00:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012412, 418688, 63130, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for everybody who have commented, voted this photograph. This is my most appreciated photograph on this site until yet. I am really very happy.<br/> <br/>Well while walking through the field for capturing some shots of natures &amp; flower I found this man sitting in the field. I like his face, turban. So, I immediately asked him to be ready for photograph &amp; that''s it. He suddenly doesn''t understand why I am taking his photo that question with intensity came into his eyes. Also he was happy in little way because he was been photographed. This mixture of expression makes this photo beautiful which I think.<br/> <br/>In comments "jrdawson" asked me for adjusting my height I appreciate the comment but I will also like to say that because my that height his little smile on his lips get hidden under his mustaches, which also makes mystical,interesting.<br/>Thanks again to everyone...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 01:01:08.</i></td>', 'Thanks a lot for everybody who have commented, voted this photograph. This is my most appreciated photograph on this site until yet. I am really very happy. Well while walking through the field for capturing some shots of natures & flower I found this man sitting in the field. I like his face, turban. So, I immediately asked him to be ready for photograph & that''s it. He suddenly doesn''t understand why I am taking his photo that question with intensity came into his eyes. Also he was happy in little way because he was been photographed. This mixture of expression makes this photo beautiful which I think. In comments "jrdawson" asked me for adjusting my height I appreciate the comment but I will also like to say that because my that height his little smile on his lips get hidden under his mustaches, which also makes mystical,interesting.Thanks again to everyone...', '2006-11-08 00:39:56.000000', '2006-11-08 01:01:08.000000', 0),
(3012420, 421056, 15266, '<td valign="top">Shannon Calvert! I am so impressed and amazed and surprised and omg, I didn''t know you were a portrait artist!  Crap, now you beat me at everything!  lol  This is uber-impressive, sir.  Great job!</td>', 'Shannon Calvert! I am so impressed and amazed and surprised and omg, I didn''t know you were a portrait artist!  Crap, now you beat me at everything!  lol  This is uber-impressive, sir.  Great job!', '2006-11-08 00:45:53.000000', NULL, 0),
