(3012577, 418998, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> If you could''ve removed the thing hanging off of the hat on the left, it''d be awesome. Love the detail of his face. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think that would be grounds for DQ if I removed it. That thing is a skeleton which is all around his mariachi hat. I wanted it in there because it help symbolize the parade he was in plus composition-wise I thought it worked as "death" appeared to chase him, which I found interesting. <br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks for the comments!</td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: If you could''ve removed the thing hanging off of the hat on the left, it''d be awesome. Love the detail of his face.   I think that would be grounds for DQ if I removed it. That thing is a skeleton which is all around his mariachi hat. I wanted it in there because it help symbolize the parade he was in plus composition-wise I thought it worked as "death" appeared to chase him, which I found interesting.  Anyway, thanks for the comments!', '2006-11-08 01:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
