(3012986, 417659, 66967, '<td valign="top">I got a lot of comments about the white background on this one, and I appreciate the input. This was the natural background. There was bright sun shining behind the chippy. I simply didn''t want to alter the photo that drastically by changing the background.</td>', 'I got a lot of comments about the white background on this one, and I appreciate the input. This was the natural background. There was bright sun shining behind the chippy. I simply didn''t want to alter the photo that drastically by changing the background.', '2006-11-08 05:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012991, 420506, 41337, '<td valign="top">Oh great! Muts with a knife? Beware!</td>', 'Oh great! Muts with a knife? Beware!', '2006-11-08 05:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012995, 421056, 3746, '<td valign="top">You made a wise choice going for this shot over the colour shot (although the colour shot is also a winner.)<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'You made a wise choice going for this shot over the colour shot (although the colour shot is also a winner.) Well done.', '2006-11-08 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3012999, 420025, 8860, '<td valign="top">I didn''t manage to vote on this, but I can say that you''ve been robbed in my view. I''m no fan of digital art at DPC but you''ve given this some thought and produced something that makes use of the landscape format and has some emotive quality. I like your scene (if a little skewed on the horizon) and the essence of the look. For me it beats all the portrait-in-portrait-tradition-but-in-a-landscape-frame shots currently occupying the higher stratas.</td>', 'I didn''t manage to vote on this, but I can say that you''ve been robbed in my view. I''m no fan of digital art at DPC but you''ve given this some thought and produced something that makes use of the landscape format and has some emotive quality. I like your scene (if a little skewed on the horizon) and the essence of the look. For me it beats all the portrait-in-portrait-tradition-but-in-a-landscape-frame shots currently occupying the higher stratas.', '2006-11-08 05:47:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3013001, 418415, 37684, '<td valign="top">Well at least it wasn''t the worst.  I understand why some saw blue in the whites of the eyes, though printed they come out white.  I''ve redone this picture a number of times in my portfolio, I think the last one is probably the best, though I believe it would have been against the rules.<br/> <br/>The one thing I do not understand is how I can get comments of nice focus on eyes, and you didn''t focus on the eyes.  <br/> <br/>I would appreciate comments on this as well as the other renditions of it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well at least it wasn''t the worst.  I understand why some saw blue in the whites of the eyes, though printed they come out white.  I''ve redone this picture a number of times in my portfolio, I think the last one is probably the best, though I believe it would have been against the rules. The one thing I do not understand is how I can get comments of nice focus on eyes, and you didn''t focus on the eyes.   I would appreciate comments on this as well as the other renditions of it. ', '2006-11-08 05:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
