(3013813, 420592, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by abhra:</b></div><hr/><i> sorry for all who has asked about the bamboo pole. but that is a bamboo stick she is holding &amp; I thought that to be an additional point to the picture breaking the normal rules. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Don''t listen to them.  The bamboo pole adds to this picture a lot.  I''m surprised this shot did not do better.  I guess the people prefer those glamorized plastic looks of the top two winners.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 10:05:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by abhra: sorry for all who has asked about the bamboo pole. but that is a bamboo stick she is holding & I thought that to be an additional point to the picture breaking the normal rules.  Don''t listen to them.  The bamboo pole adds to this picture a lot.  I''m surprised this shot did not do better.  I guess the people prefer those glamorized plastic looks of the top two winners.', '2006-11-08 10:04:53.000000', '2006-11-08 10:05:22.000000', 0),
