(3013835, 418201, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat. Love the expression. I like the shot, but it does all blend together.  Maybe a bit more contrast or something to get away from the all gray feeling.  Also, since this was advanced editing, you could''ve taken advantage of the green eyes.  I''m not a particular fan of that technique, but others seem to like it.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful cat. Love the expression. I like the shot, but it does all blend together.  Maybe a bit more contrast or something to get away from the all gray feeling.  Also, since this was advanced editing, you could''ve taken advantage of the green eyes.  I''m not a particular fan of that technique, but others seem to like it.', '2006-11-08 10:08:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3013866, 421056, 64446, '<td valign="top">You should be proud indeed, of a beautiful daughter and a superb job on this portrait - both B&amp;W and color, but I think you chose right. Congratulations!!   (and I don''t get those low scores either).</td>', 'You should be proud indeed, of a beautiful daughter and a superb job on this portrait - both B&W and color, but I think you chose right. Congratulations!!   (and I don''t get those low scores either).', '2006-11-08 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
