(3013979, 417251, 66696, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes and comments.<br/> <br/>On the negative space, this image was not shot for this competition, but rather for a portfolio book that I happed to be working on the day the comp was started. This image is stretched between 2 pages, the subject on one page and the "blank" area on another and is used as a container for some other images of the subject and some text.<br/> <br/>This was my first entry on this site and I''m happy with my placing, thank you all!</td>', 'Thanks for all the votes and comments. On the negative space, this image was not shot for this competition, but rather for a portfolio book that I happed to be working on the day the comp was started. This image is stretched between 2 pages, the subject on one page and the "blank" area on another and is used as a container for some other images of the subject and some text. This was my first entry on this site and I''m happy with my placing, thank you all!', '2006-11-08 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 0),
