(3014261, 420488, 43031, '<td valign="top">hey! I just found this, nice work again! You''ve got so much natural talent, I''d like to have just a little bit more of that. You remind me so much of Joey Lawrence or sjcarter, using the little camera for all that it''s worth, and winning with it. Love it.</td>', 'hey! I just found this, nice work again! You''ve got so much natural talent, I''d like to have just a little bit more of that. You remind me so much of Joey Lawrence or sjcarter, using the little camera for all that it''s worth, and winning with it. Love it.', '2006-11-08 12:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3014329, 421056, 66193, '<td valign="top">An absolute winner!  I hadn''t voted on this during the challenge, but I definitely would have scored it a 10.  perfect in every way.  You should be proud of this one.</td>', 'An absolute winner!  I hadn''t voted on this during the challenge, but I definitely would have scored it a 10.  perfect in every way.  You should be proud of this one.', '2006-11-08 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3014395, 419824, 48389, '<td valign="top">What fantastic colours, bet it takes this guy ages to do his make up before leaving the house!! Great DOF here and I love the placement of the ''model'' in the frame. I would agree with your comment below, maybe this was hit hard with the ''more Candid than Portrait'' thing which is a pity as  for me its a good image!</td>', 'What fantastic colours, bet it takes this guy ages to do his make up before leaving the house!! Great DOF here and I love the placement of the ''model'' in the frame. I would agree with your comment below, maybe this was hit hard with the ''more Candid than Portrait'' thing which is a pity as  for me its a good image!', '2006-11-08 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3014418, 420877, 53572, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mcrochip:</b></div><hr/><i> This would be a great shot, if only the lens was clean.  Those spots are a distraction. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i think you mean her moles?</td>', 'Originally posted by mcrochip: This would be a great shot, if only the lens was clean.  Those spots are a distraction.   i think you mean her moles?', '2006-11-08 12:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
