(3015311, 421056, 47852, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saiphfire:</b></div><hr/><i> One thing I love about your shots is that you always give us a detailed description of how you took them. I wish everyone would take the extra seconds to do that. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''ll second that!  I always enjoy reading your photographers comments, even on something as simple and as this photo.  Your daughter has really grown up over the last 2 years compared to your first 7+ photo... we''ll keep an eye out in 2008 for the same chair to see how much more she''s grown!  Congrats on the ribbon... well deserved! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by saiphfire: One thing I love about your shots is that you always give us a detailed description of how you took them. I wish everyone would take the extra seconds to do that.   I''ll second that!  I always enjoy reading your photographers comments, even on something as simple and as this photo.  Your daughter has really grown up over the last 2 years compared to your first 7+ photo... we''ll keep an eye out in 2008 for the same chair to see how much more she''s grown!  Congrats on the ribbon... well deserved! :)', '2006-11-08 16:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
