(3018011, 419338, 15772, '<td valign="top">Well, thank god that''s over, phew!<br/> <br/>Ok so it was very late at night after coming home from a night out and obviously I my perception was a bit off when I read and entered this challenge. I must have gotten excited that I took this photo within the challenge date and I could have sworn it said something different.<br/> <br/>In any case, thanks for all the comments, wish it would have rated a bit higher but I can understand considering the circumstances. Seriously though, those of you that left critique''s thanks again, any advice is helpful.</td>', 'Well, thank god that''s over, phew! Ok so it was very late at night after coming home from a night out and obviously I my perception was a bit off when I read and entered this challenge. I must have gotten excited that I took this photo within the challenge date and I could have sworn it said something different. In any case, thanks for all the comments, wish it would have rated a bit higher but I can understand considering the circumstances. Seriously though, those of you that left critique''s thanks again, any advice is helpful.', '2006-11-09 15:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
