(3021619, 419824, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is an entertaining colorful character!  Overall a decent and interesting shot too.  Love the bokeh of the crowd.  IMO perhaps a perspective where we could see a little more of his face might have been nice and a sharper focus on the fan would improve the image.  These are just guesses on my part and I have no idea what kind of limitations you were dealing with in the field.</td>', 'This is an entertaining colorful character!  Overall a decent and interesting shot too.  Love the bokeh of the crowd.  IMO perhaps a perspective where we could see a little more of his face might have been nice and a sharper focus on the fan would improve the image.  These are just guesses on my part and I have no idea what kind of limitations you were dealing with in the field.', '2006-11-11 08:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
