(3036667, 419338, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m going through some of the comments I have made and clicking on those the didn''t check the helpful button.  Some of them I totally understand why and have no problem with it (including yours) so I''m trying to leave comments that ARE helpful.  For the photo itself (not the wrong challenge issue) I think it is a very nice photo.  Not sure if you increased sat in pp but if so then maybe just a bit too much.  You have to find the happy medium.  You want to saturate a bit more to make the sky pop and it looks great the way you have it right now except the red trees are just a bit oversaturated.  If it fit the  challenge I think I would have given it a 7.</td>', 'I''m going through some of the comments I have made and clicking on those the didn''t check the helpful button.  Some of them I totally understand why and have no problem with it (including yours) so I''m trying to leave comments that ARE helpful.  For the photo itself (not the wrong challenge issue) I think it is a very nice photo.  Not sure if you increased sat in pp but if so then maybe just a bit too much.  You have to find the happy medium.  You want to saturate a bit more to make the sky pop and it looks great the way you have it right now except the red trees are just a bit oversaturated.  If it fit the  challenge I think I would have given it a 7.', '2006-11-16 03:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
