(3217007, 420573, 48115, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju með þessa mynd, þá meina ég að hún hafi komið út í þarna blaðinu.. Þetta blað var óskaplega ómerkilegur pappír í raun en myndin þín tosaði það slatta upp á við. Ég verð að segja að ég var frekar stolt að geta sagt hey sjáiði þennan, ég veit hver hann er :) En já semsagt en og aftur til hamingju Magnús</td>', 'Til hamingju með þessa mynd, þá meina ég að hún hafi komið út í þarna blaðinu.. Þetta blað var óskaplega ómerkilegur pappír í raun en myndin þín tosaði það slatta upp á við. Ég verð að segja að ég var frekar stolt að geta sagt hey sjáiði þennan, ég veit hver hann er :) En já semsagt en og aftur til hamingju Magnús', '2007-01-12 07:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3220874, 418850, 69700, '<td valign="top">I love the photo of the flower girl.  This is definitely a keeper just the way it is, but if you have photoshop you can replace the background so your eyes are not distracted from the girl in the background.  I agree with the others about the fill flash, I have find using a fill flash can improve most outdoor portraits.</td>', 'I love the photo of the flower girl.  This is definitely a keeper just the way it is, but if you have photoshop you can replace the background so your eyes are not distracted from the girl in the background.  I agree with the others about the fill flash, I have find using a fill flash can improve most outdoor portraits.', '2007-01-12 16:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3225667, 420450, 60183, '<td valign="top">crop might be a little funny as you already pointed out, a little bold for DPC I think.  I wish the face was sharper as well</td>', 'crop might be a little funny as you already pointed out, a little bold for DPC I think.  I wish the face was sharper as well', '2007-01-13 12:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3236044, 417682, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I don''t know how I missed this for so long!  What an awesome photo.  Is that you?  You missed your calling as a Vogue magazine model :)<br/> <br/>I love the crisp sharp processing and high contrast.  It''s just beautiful in every way.<br/></td>', 'Wow!  I don''t know how I missed this for so long!  What an awesome photo.  Is that you?  You missed your calling as a Vogue magazine model :) I love the crisp sharp processing and high contrast.  It''s just beautiful in every way.', '2007-01-15 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
