(4883723, 420506, 27373, '<td valign="top">Oh, now this brings back memories....not the good kind.  Did we date about five years ago????<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Arti-Elvi:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>I feel that I overprocessed this one.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Overprocessed does well on DPC.  I think the processing suits this image very well.  It gives in that "insane inmate" feel.</td>', 'Oh, now this brings back memories....not the good kind.  Did we date about five years ago???? Originally posted by Arti-Elvi: I feel that I overprocessed this one.  Overprocessed does well on DPC.  I think the processing suits this image very well.  It gives in that "insane inmate" feel.', '2008-08-12 20:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
